ess album.",screen_recording6:"Insufficient storage space. Content may be lost.",screen_recording5:"Screen capture failed.",screen_recording4:"Screen shot successful.",screen_recording3:"Finish recording.",screen_recording2:"Recording failed.",screen_recording1:"Start recording.",dust_collection_life9:"Approximately ${time} time(s) before emptying",dust_collection_life8:"The large-capacity dust bag is used to collect the garbage from the robot dustbin, eliminating the need for frequent manual emptying, ensuring a clean and worry-free experience. For the best cleaning experience, it is recommended to replace the dust bag as needed and clean the dustbin once a month.",dust_collection_life5:"Dust bag",dust_collection_life4:"Roborock Auto-Empty Dock is equipped with a 15-cone cyclone separator to move the dust into the dustbin, featuring one-press Dustbin Opener, no consumables, and lasting powerful suction. The dustbin has a capacity of 1.5 L. It is recommended to empty it every 1 to 2 months.",dust_collection_life3:"Dustbin emptied. OK?",dust_collection_life2:"Dustbin is due for emptying.",dust_collection_life1:"Dustbin",smart_scene_global_title:"Routines Set",voice_chat_title2:"In video call. Unable to record.",voice_chat_title1:"Stop screen recording.",home_page_supplies_cleaning_brush3:"The dock's maintenance brush rotates back and forth at high speed, closely adhering to the surface of the mop to scrub, effectively removing dirt from the mop surface. During the mopping process, foreign objects such as tangled hair may accumulate, affecting the mopping effect. It is recommended to disassemble and clean it every two months.",home_page_supplies_cleaning_brush2:"Maintenance brush has been replaced. OK?",home_page_supplies_cleaning_brush1:"High-speed maintenance brush",home_page_supplies_cleaning_brush:"Maintenance brush is due for replacement.",inner_error_desc_149:"Maintenance brush positioning error - right",inner_error_desc_148:"Maintenance brush positioning error 