zone_title:"Cliff No-Go Zone ",map_edit_cliff_zone_detail:"Cliff detected here repeatedly. No-go zone generated automatically. Setting cliff as no-go zone allows the robot to work more efficiently.\n*If the robot has no risk of falling here, you may ignore it.\n*If the size and location of the no-go zone are incorrect, adjust accordingly.",setting_carpet_deep_clean_switch_title:"Deep Carpet Cleaning",setting_carpet_deep_clean_switch_desc:"After Room Cleaning, the robot will separately clean carpets in each room. \n*Not including mats.",map_ai_zone_bubble_set:"Tap to confirm entrapping area",map_ai_zone_bubble_adjust:"Tap to adjust no-go zone",warning_for_will_delete_wifi:"After deletion, the robot will stop attempting to connect to this WiFi.",wifi_page_current_wifi:"Current WiFi Connection",wifi_page_others_wifi:"Other WiFi Connections",wifi_page_title:"WiFi",map_edit_floor_wood_width:"Floor (Horizontal)",map_edit_floor_wood_longti:"Floor (Vertical)",ground_material_clean_direction_title:"Clean along floor direction",ground_material_clean_direction_detail:"In Full Cleaning or Selective Room Cleaning, the robot will clean the floor along its direction to minimize scraping against the floor seams.\n*Set the floor material for this function to work. The robot can only clean in one direction.",map_edit_door_sill_exceed_limit:"Maximum number of door thresholds reached.",map_cliff_zone_guide_text:"Cliff detected here repeatedly. No-go zone set automatically.",map_stuck_point_guide_text:"The robot gets trapped here repeatedly. Set a no-go zone.",map_door_sill_guide_text:"Threshold detected here. Set a threshold zone.",clean_route_fast_mode_title:"Fast",wifi_rssi_title:"Signal Strength",map_object_desc_sanxian:"Cords/wires avoided, preventing tangling. Long, thin cords may still be tangled.",map_object_desc_chongwu:"Pets recognized, preventing collision and disturbance.",map_object_desc_zhituan:"Fabric/paper balls recognized, preventing tangling and entrapment.",map_object