e\u0219uat. Re\xeencerca\u021bi.",video_is_loading:"Se \xeencarc\u0103...",real_time_monitor_privacy_desc:"Func\u021bia Video \xeen timp real nu salveaz\u0103 clipurile video. Toate datele video sunt \u0219terse dup\u0103 \xeencheierea apelului video. Aceasta asigur\u0103 p\u0103strarea \xeen siguran\u021b\u0103 a datelor dvs. video. Pentru mai multe informa\u021bii, v\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 consulta\u021bi",video_definition_normal:"LD",video_definition_high:"HD",button_title_agree:"De acord",camera_setting_open_rrai_tip:"Activarea evit\u0103rii obstacolelor",camera_monitor_privacy_title:"Politica de confiden\u021bialitate privind video \xeen timp real",home_load_map_title:"H\u0103r\u021bi",setting_on:"PORNIT",setting_auto:"AUTOMAT",map_save_pop_box_overwrite:"Salvare",setting_realtime_monitor_switch_title:"Video \xeen timp real",robot_status_clean_mop_mode:"Asp. + mop",common_setting_secure_setting:"Set\u0103ri de securitate",share_view_device_from:"De la:",error_visual_sensor_detail:"Senzorul de vizibilitate este murdar sau blocat. Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi senzorul vizibilitate.",error_visual_sensor_subtitle:"Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi senzorul vizibilitate.",error_visual_sensor_title:"Eroare senzor vizibilitate",map_edit_virtual_wall_too_close_to_robot:"Robotul nu poate fi prea aproape de peretele invizibil",map_edit_forbidden_contain_robot:"Robotul nu poate fi \xeen zona \u201eno-go\u201d",reminder_bad_network:"Nu s-au putut sincroniza datele h\u0103r\u021bii din cauza vitezei reduse a re\u021belei. Verifica\u021bi-v\u0103 re\u021beaua",localization_strings_Setting_RemoteControlPage_50:"Actualiza\u021bi cu cea mai recent\u0103 versiune a aplica\u021biei \u0219i \xeencerca\u021bi din nou",localization_strings_Setting_General_index_5:"Informa\u021bii re\u021bea",localization_strings_Setting_General_index_0:"Necunoscut",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_3:"Suprafa\u021b\u0103 cas\u0103",localization_strings_Common_Constants_10:"Eroare de \xeenc\u0103rcare",debug_info_copy_success:"Copiat",rubys_cleanmode_mop_alert_descript:"Robotul va reduce puterea de aspirare la minim. Aceasta poate fi aplicat\u0103 o singur\u0103 dat\u0103.",rubys_setting_guide_contact_report_succ:"Se \xeencarc\u0103",revert_agreement_privacy:"Revocarea Acordului cu utilizatorul \u0219i a Politicii de confiden\u021bialitate",check_and_read_agreement_privacy:"Vizualiza\u021bi Acordul cu utilizatorul \u0219i Politica de confiden\u021bialitate",multi_map_function_description_text_1:"Pot fi salvate p\xe2n\u0103 la patru h\u0103r\u021bi ale unei cl\u0103diri cu mai multe etaje. Robotul va detecta \u0219i va comuta la harta relevant\u0103.",multi_map_timer_select_map_title:"Zona de curatenie",multi_map_timer_select_map_stop_task_title:"Finalizare \u0219i vizualizare",multi_map_timer_not_current_map_tip:"Robotul utilizeaz\u0103 alt\u0103 hart\u0103. Termina\u021bi sarcina curent\u0103 pentru a vizualiza harta.",new_map_entrance_in_multiMap_0:"Crea\u021bi o hart\u0103 nou\u0103",localization_strings_Setting_RemoteControlPage_41:"\xcenc\u0103rcare",localization_strings_Setting_RemoteControlPage_40:"Andocare",localization_strings_Setting_RemoteControlPage_19:"Cur\u0103\u021barea \u201epunct\u201d este \xeen desf\u0103\u0219urare.",localization_strings_Setting_RemoteControlPage_13:"\xcen proces de actualizare, \xeencerca\u021bi mai t\xe2rziu.",room_already_exist:"Camer\u0103 cu acest nume exist\u0103 deja",load_map_overime_tip:"Re\u021beaua curent\u0103 este lent\u0103. V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 a\u0219tepta\u021bi.",clean_sequence_not_set_for_all_segments_tip:"La final, robotul cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 zonele neordonate una dup\u0103 alta.",single_floor_save_new_map_home_multifloor:"Casa mea are mai multe etaje",single_floor_save_new_map_tip:"Nu salva\u021bi mai multe h\u0103r\u021bi ale aceluia\u0219i etaj, deoarece este posibil ca robotul s\u0103 nu reu\u0219easc\u0103 s\u0103-\u0219i identifice cu exactitate loca\u021bia.",continue_save:"Continua\u021bi s