 robotul pe suportul de andocare pentru a prelungi durata de via\u021b\u0103 a bateriei.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_97:"Complet \xeenc\u0103rcat\u0103",localization_strings_Main_Constants_96:"Robotul nu va relua cur\u0103\u021benia sau nu va reda vocal \xeen modul DND",localization_strings_Main_Constants_95:"Modul DND este pornit.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_92:"Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi filtrul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_91:"Filtrul este blocat.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_84:"Nivelul bateriei mai mic de 20 %. Cur\u0103\u021benie programat\u0103 anulat\u0103",localization_strings_Main_Constants_82:"Pornirea cur\u0103\u021b\u0103rii programate.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_80:"Sup. de andocare nu a fost g\u0103sit. Elimina\u021bi obstacolele \u0219i cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi cont. de \xeenc\u0103rcare.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_78:"Baterie desc\u0103rcat\u0103. Revenire la suportul de andocare.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_73:"Baterie \xeenc\u0103rcat\u0103. Reluare cur\u0103\u021bare",localization_strings_Main_Constants_72:"Suportul de andocare nu a fost g\u0103sit. Nu a revenit la punct de pornire.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_71:"Suportul de andocare nu a fost g\u0103sit. Revenit la punctul de pornire",localization_strings_Main_Constants_70:"Re\xeenc\u0103rcare",localization_strings_Main_Constants_68:"Cur\u0103\u021bare finalizat\u0103",localization_strings_Main_Constants_67:"Nivel sc\u0103zut baterie, \xeenc\u0103rca\u021bi robotul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_66:"\xcenc\u0103rca\u021bi robotul",localization_strings_Main_Constants_65:"Co\u0219ul de gunoi nu a fost golit de ceva timp. Goli\u021bi-l acum.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_64:"Goli\u021bi co\u0219ul de gunoi \xeen mod regulat.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_63:"Goli\u021bi co\u0219ul de gunoi",localization_strings_Main_Constants_62:"Defec\u021biune cauzat\u0103 de o eroare intern\u0103. Reseta\u021bi robotul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_60:"Eroare intern\u0103",localization_strings_Main_Constants_56:"Este posibil ca, cablul de alimentare s\u0103 nu fie corect ata\u0219at la suportul de andocare. Reconecta\u021bi-l \u0219i \xeencerca\u021bi din nou.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_55:"Verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 este conectat cablul de alimentare.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_54:"Sta\u021bia de andocare nu este conectat\u0103 la priz\u0103.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_53:"Reseta\u021bi robotul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_51:"Eroare ventilator",localization_strings_Main_Constants_50:"Peria lateral\u0103 nu func\u021bioneaz\u0103. Reseta\u021bi robotul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_49:"Reseta\u021bi robotul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_48:"Eroare perie lateral\u0103",localization_strings_Main_Constants_47:"Robotul este \xeenclinat. A\u0219eza\u021bi-l pe o suprafa\u021b\u0103 plan\u0103 \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_46:"A\u0219eza\u021bi-l pe o suprafa\u021b\u0103 plan\u0103 \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_45:"Robotul este \xeenclinat",localization_strings_Main_Constants_44:"Senzorul de perete este murdar. Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi senzorul de perete.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_43:"Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi senzorul de perete",localization_strings_Main_Constants_42:"Senzorul de perete este murdar.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_41:"Temperatura bateriei este prea ridicat\u0103 sau prea sc\u0103zut\u0103, a\u0219tepta\u021bi s\u0103 revin\u0103 la temperatura normal\u0103.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_40:"A\u0219tepta\u021bi p\xe2n\u0103 c\xe2nd temperatura bateriei revine la normal",localization_strings_Main_Constants_39:"Eroare baterie",localization_strings_Main_Constants_38:"Folosi\u021bi o lavet\u0103 uscat\u0103 pentru a cur\u0103\u021ba contactele de \xeenc\u0103rcare ale sta\u021biei de andocare \u0219i ale robotului.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_37:"Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi contactele de \xeenc\u0103rcare \u0219i decupla\u021bi docul, apoi reconecta\u021bi-l la priz\u0103 \u0219i re\xeencerca\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_34:"\xcenc\u0103rca\u021bi robotul \xeenainte de utilizare.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_33:"Baterie desc\u0103rcat\u0103",localization_strings_Main_Constants_32:"Robotul este prea aproape de un perete virtual sau de un c\xe2mp magnetic puternic. Muta\u021bi-l \xeentr-o loca\u021bie nou\u0103 \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_30:"S-a detectat un c\xe2mp magnetic puternic",localization_strings_Main_Constants_29:"Filtrul este umed, usca\u021bi filtrul cel pu\u021bin 24 ore. Filtrul poate necesita \u0219i cur\u0103\u021bare. Dac\u0103 problema persist\u0103, \xeencerca\u021bi s\u0103 \xeenlocui\u021bi filtrul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_28:"Usca\u021bi sau cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi filtrul",localization_strings_Main_Constants_27:"Filtrul este umed sau blocat.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_26:"Reinstala\u021bi co\u0219ul de gunoi \u0219i filtrul. Dac\u0103 problema persist\u0103, \xeencerca\u021bi s\u0103 \xeenlocui\u021bi filtrul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_25:"Reinstala\u021bi co\u0219ul de gunoi \u0219i filtrul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_24:"Co\u0219ul de gunoi nu este instalat",localization_strings_Main_Constants_23:"Elimina\u021bi orice obstacole din jurul robotului. Sau muta\u021bi robotul \xeentr-o nou\u0103 loca\u021bie \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_22:"Elimina\u021bi orice obstacole din jurul robotului.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_21:"Robotul este prins sau blocat.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_20:"Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi ro\u021bile principale, apoi muta\u021bi robotul \xeentr-o nou\u0103 loca\u021bie \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_19:"Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi ro\u021bile principale sau muta\u021bi robotul \xeentr-o nou\u0103 loca\u021bie \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_18:"Robotul este blocat sau ro\u021bile sale sunt blocate.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_17:"Scoate\u021bi peria lateral\u0103, cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi-o \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_16:"Scoate\u021bi \u0219i cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi peria lateral\u0103.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_15:"Peria lateral\u0103 este blocat\u0103.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_14:"Scoate\u021bi peria principal\u0103, cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi peria \u0219i rulmentul \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_13:"Scoate\u021bi peria principal\u0103 \u0219i cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi peria \u0219i rulmentul.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_12:"Peria principal\u0103 este blocat\u0103.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_11:"Robotul este suspendat. Muta\u021bi-l \xeentr-o loca\u021bie nou\u0103 \u0219i reporni\u021bi. Eroarea poate fi cauzat\u0103 \u0219i de senzorii anti-c\u0103dere murdari; cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi senzorii anti-c\u0103dere \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_10:"Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi senzorii anti-c\u0103dere, apoi muta\u021bi robotul \xeentr-o nou\u0103 loca\u021bie \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_9:"Eroare senzor anti-c\u0103dere",localization_strings_Main_Constants_7:"Muta\u021bi robotul \xeentr-o nou\u0103 loca\u021bie \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_6:"Ro\u021bi suspendate",localization_strings_Main_Constants_5:"Bumperul este blocat. Atinge\u021bi \xeen mod repetat bumperul pentru a disloca elementele blocate. Dac\u0103 nu mai iese nimic, muta\u021bi robotul \xeentr-o nou\u0103 loca\u021bie \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_4:"Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi \u0219i lovi\u021bi u\u0219or bumperul",localization_strings_Main_Constants_3:"Bumper (amortizor) blocat",localization_strings_Main_Constants_2:"LDS este blocat. \xcendep\u0103rta\u021bi orice obstacole, apoi muta\u021bi robotul \xeentr-o nou\u0103 loca\u021bie \u0219i reporni\u021bi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_1:"Roti\u021bi senzorul laser pentru a verifica dac\u0103 se rote\u0219te liber.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_0:"Eroare senzor laser",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_2:"Or\u0103",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_1:"Baterie",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_0:"Zon\u0103",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_4:"Delicat",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_3:"Max",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_2:"Turbo",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_1:"Echilibrat",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_0:"Silen\u021bios",localization_strings_Common_Constants_19:"Se \xeencarc\u0103",localization_strings_Common_Constants_18:"Offline",localization_strings_Common_Constants_17:"\xcenc\u0103rcat compl.",localization_strings_Common_Constants_15:"Se actualizeaz\u0103",localization_strings_Common_Constants_13:"Eroare",localization_strings_Common_Constants_12:"Cur\u0103\u021bare \u201epunct\u201d",localization_strings_Common_Constants_11:"Pauz\u0103",localization_strings_Common_Constants_8:"\xcenc\u0103rcare",localization_strings_Common_Constants_6:"Andocare",localization_strings_Common_Constants_4:"Control de la distan\u021b\u0103",localization_strings_Common_Constants_3:"Preg\u0103tit",localization_strings_Common_Constants_2:"Repaus",localization_strings_Common_Constants_1:"Cur\u0103\u021bare",localization_strings_Common_Constants_0:"Ob\u021binere informa\u021bii",map_edit_furniture_sofa_single:"Canapea single",map_edit_furniture_sofa_double:"Canapea dubla",map_edit_furniture_sofa_three:"Canapea cu mai multe locuri",map_edit_furniture_sofa_sectional:"Canapea modulara",map_edit_furniture_shoe_cabinet:"Suport de pantofi",map_edit_furniture_wardrobe:"Dulap pentru haine",map_edit_furniture_night_stand:"Noptier\u0103",voice_chat_tips:"Pentru a asigura siguran\u021ba, videoclipul va fi deconectat automat dup\u0103 o or\u0103 de la apel, v\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 \xeel porni\u021bi din nou.",back_wash_title1:"dup\u0103 camer\u0103",back_wash_title2:"Cu timpul",accessibility_back:"\xcentoarcere",accessibility_guide:"Ajutor",accessibility_add:"Ad\u0103uga",map_edit_furniture_rect_table:"Masa patrata",map_obstacles_title18:"Obstacol",accessibility_on:"Deschis",map_type_2d:"2D",map_type_3d:"3D",map_type_ar:"Matrix",map_furniture_guide_title:"Recunoa\u0219tere elemente de mobilier",map_furniture_guide_detail:"${count} elemente de mobilier au fost recunoscute. Atinge\u021bi pentru a vizualiza.",map_furniture_guide_save_tip:"Dup\u0103 salvare, modelele elementelor de mobilier vor fi ad\u0103ugate la hart\u0103. V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 mobilierul este a\u0219ezat corect.",home_sepecial_tip_for_only_mop:"Doar sp\u0103lare | O singur\u0103 utilizare",home_sepecial_tip_for_only_clean:"Doar aspirare | O singur\u0103 utilizare",switch_ar_map_when_map_unsaved_tip:"Salva\u021bi harta \xeenainte de a utiliza aceast\u0103 func\u021bie",home_new_control_start_collect:"Golire rezervor de praf",robot_status_egg_attack:"scanare",reset_privacy_dialog_content:"Revoca\u021bi autoriza\u021bia?",new_dock_charging_or_full_charging_title:"\xcenc\u0103rcare",robot_status_wait_charge:"\xcenc\u0103rcare \xeen curs",robot_status_wait_charge1:"\xcenc\u0103rcare \xeen afara orelor de v\xe2rf",robot_status_wait_charge2:"Robotul se va \xeenc\u0103rca complet numai \xeen afara orelor de v\xe2rf.\xa0\xcen restul timpului, nivelul energiei va fi men\u021binut la minimum. ",robot_status_wait_charge3:"Not\u0103:\xa0\xcenc\u0103rcare prioritar\u0103 \xeen afara orelor de v\xe2rf",robot_status_wait_charge4:"1. \xcenc\u0103rcarea \xeen timpul orelor de v\xe2rf poate fi necesar\u0103 pentru finalizarea unui proces de cur\u0103\u021bare.",robot_status_wait_charge5:"2. \xcenc\u0103rcarea se va realiza \xeen timpul orelor de v\xe2rf doar pentru a m