de pe podea. Se recomand\u0103 ad\u0103ugarea \xeen func\u021bie de necesit\u0103\u021bi.",map_edit_floor_wood_tile:"Tip pardoseal\u0103",smart_scene_custom_commands:"Fluxurile mele de lucru",smart_scene_recommend_commands:"Fluxuri de lucru recomandate",smart_scene_more:"Detalii",smart_scene_input_dialog_title:"Introducere nume flux de lucru",smart_scene_edit_title:"Editare flux de lucru",smart_scene_reached_max_command_count_toast_hint:"Ad\u0103ugare p\xe2n\u0103 la 10 fluxuri de lucru",smart_scene_add_command_success:"Ad\u0103ugat",smart_scene_add_dining_room_and_kitchen_hint:"Selecta\u021bi buc\u0103t\u0103ria \u0219i sufrageria dvs.",smart_scene_add_command_button_title:"Ad\u0103ugare fluxuri de lucru preferate",smart_scene_edit_switch_map_warning_title:"\xcenlocuirea h\u0103r\u021bii va \u0219terge fluxul de lucru \u0219i programele de cur\u0103\u021bare stabilite.",smart_scene_edit_button_title_done:"Finalizare",smart_scene_delete_timer:"\u0218tergere program",smart_scene_rename:"Redenumire",smart_scene_recommend_global_clean_title:"Cur\u0103\u021bare complet\u0103",smart_scene_recommend_clean_after_meal:"Dup\u0103 mese",localization_strings_Setting_General_index_1:"Nume robot",map_edit_custom_mode:"Set\u0103ri mod",smart_scene_add_command:"Ad\u0103ugare flux de lucru",unsave_map_reason_1:"Docul a fost mutat. Hart\u0103 nesalvat\u0103.",unsave_map_reason_2:"Pozi\u021bionarea a e\u0219uat. Recartografiere. ",unsave_map_reason_3:"A fost atins num\u0103rul maxim de h\u0103r\u021bi. Hart\u0103 nesalvat\u0103.",unsave_map_reason_4:"Cur\u0103\u021bare incomplet\u0103. Hart\u0103 nesalvat\u0103.",unsave_map_reason_5:"Nu a pornit de la doc. Hart\u0103 nesalvat\u0103.",unsave_map_reason_6:"Nu poate reveni la doc. Hart\u0103 nesalvat\u0103.",unsave_map_alert_content:"Este posibil ca harta de cur\u0103\u021bare s\u0103 fi fost modificat\u0103 \xeen timpul cur\u0103\u021b\u0103rii. Dori\u021bi s\u0103 recupera\u021bi harta salvat\u0103?",robot_setting_self_cleaning_title:"Set\u0103rile docului",mainpage_unknown_segment_click_tips:"Zona desemnat\u0103 nu poate fi selectat\u0103. Accesa\u021bi sec\u021biunea \u201eEditare camer\u0103\u201d din aplica\u021bie \u0219i defini\u021bi manual aceast\u0103 zon\u0103 drept camer\u0103 pentru a deveni selectabil\u0103.",dock_kit_setting15:"Selecta\u021bi intensitatea de sp\u0103lare \xeen func\u021bie de gradul de murd\u0103rire a podelei.",dock_kit_setting16:"Selecta\u021bi frecven\u021ba cu care robotul revine pentru sp\u0103larea mopului. ",dock_kit_setting17:"Porni\u021bi/opri\u021bi auto-uscarea dup\u0103 sp\u0103lare.",history_mark_zone_exceed_limit:"A fost atins num\u0103rul maxim de marcaje",localization_strings_Setting_DoNotDisturbPage_3:"Dezactiva\u021bi func\u021bia \u201eRe\xeenc\u0103rcare automat\u0103\u201d",localization_strings_Setting_DoNotDisturbPage_4:"Activa\u021bi modul silen\u021bios pentru alertele vocale",localization_strings_Setting_DoNotDisturbPage_5:"Reduce\u021bi luminozitatea indicatorilor lumino\u0219i",localization_strings_Setting_DoNotDisturbPage_6:"Dezactiva\u021bi golirea automat\u0103",localization_strings_Setting_DoNotDisturbPage_7:"Dezactiva\u021bi uscarea automat\u0103",localization_strings_Setting_DoNotDisturbPage_8:"Personaliza\u021bi modul \u201eNu deranja\u021bi\u201d",setting_section_title2:"Controlul dispozitivului",map_edit_select_one_map:"H\u0103r\u021bi",home_sepecial_tip_for_only_mop_collectdusk:"Doar sp\u0103lare | O singur\u0103 utilizare",build_map_finish_guide_title:"Hart\u0103 salvat\u0103. Recunoa\u0219tere inteligent\u0103 a mediului.",build_map_finish_guide_content:"Harta se va actualiza \xeen timpul cur\u0103\u021b\u0103rii; porni\u021bi cur\u0103\u021barea complet\u0103 pentru a crea o hart\u0103 cu toate camerele identificate.",build_map_map_edit_guide_title:"Edita\u021bi harta pentru ca robotul s\u0103 cunoasc\u0103 mai bine ambientul.",build_map_map_edit_guide_content:"Accesa\u021bi pagina de editare a h\u0103r\u021bii pentru a stabili secven\u021bele de cur\u0103\u021bare, pentru a configura zona interzis\u0103 \u0219i pentru a edita camerele \xeen vederea ob\u021binerii unei experien\u021be de cur\u0103\u021bare superioare. ",home_new_control_start_dry:"Uscare",map_edit_door_sill_title:"Prag cu risc de blocare",map_edit_door_sill_slide:"Prag \xeentr-un hol \xeengust",map_edit_door_sill_stone:"Praguri din piatr\u0103",error_temperature_protection_desc:"Muta\u021bi robotul \xeentr-o loca\u021bie la temperatura camerei \u0219i a\u0219tepta\u021bi un timp.",error_temperature_protection_title:"Unitate cu protec\u021bie la temperatur\u0103",map_edit_add_ai_zone:"Configura\u021bi o \u201ezon\u0103 interzis\u0103\u201d",map_edit_add_door_sill:"Configura\u021bi un prag",map_edit_cliff_zone_adjust:"Ajusta\u021bi \u201ezona interzis\u0103\u201d",map_edit_door_sill_title2:"Mi\u0219c\u0103ri inteligente peste praguri pentru a reduce blocajele",map_edit_door_sill_detail:"Robotul se mi\u0219c\u0103 \xeen mod inteligent \u0219i trece cu u\u0219urin\u021b\u0103 peste praguri f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 efectueze cur\u0103\u021barea.",map_edit_stuck_zone_title:"Zon\u0103 cu risc de blocare",map_edit_stuck_zone_detail:"Robotul se blocheaz\u0103 des aici. Configura\u021bi o \u201ezon\u0103 interzis\u0103\u201d pe care robotul s\u0103 o ocoleasc\u0103.\n*Dac\u0103 nu dori\u021bi aceasta, ap\u0103sa\u021bi \u201eIgnorare\u201d.",map_edit_cliff_zone_title:"Zon\u0103 abrupt\u0103 interzis\u0103",map_edit_cliff_zone_detail:"Aici se detecteaz\u0103 des o zon\u0103 abrupt\u0103. Se genereaz\u0103 automat o \u201ezon\u0103 interzis\u0103\u201d. Configurarea unei zone abrupte ca \u201ezon\u0103 interzis\u0103\u201d permite robotului s\u0103 func\u021bioneze mai eficient.\r\n*Dac\u0103 nu exist\u0103 risc de c\u0103dere aici, ignora\u021bi.\r\n*Dac\u0103 dimensiunea \u0219i pozi\u021bionarea \u201ezonei interzise\u201d sunt incorecte, ajusta\u021bi.",setting_carpet_deep_clean_switch_title:"Cur\u0103\u021bare profund\u0103 a covorului",setting_carpet_deep_clean_switch_desc:"Dup\u0103 cur\u0103\u021barea camerei, robotul va cur\u0103\u021ba separat covoarele din fiecare camer\u0103. \n*Nu sunt incluse pre\u0219urile.",map_ai_zone_bubble_set:"Ap\u0103sa\u021bi pentru a confirma zona cu risc de blocare",map_ai_zone_bubble_adjust:"Ap\u0103sa\u021bi pentru a ajusta \u201ezona interzis\u0103\u201d",warning_for_will_delete_wifi:"Dup\u0103 \u0219tergere, robotul nu va mai \xeencerca s\u0103 se conecteze la aceast\u0103 re\u021bea WiFi.",wifi_page_current_wifi:"Conexiune WiFi curent\u0103",wifi_page_others_wifi:"Alte conexiuni WiFi",wifi_page_title:"WiFi",map_edit_floor_wood_width:"Pardoseal\u0103 (orizontal)",map_edit_floor_wood_longti:"Pardoseal\u0103 (vertical)",ground_material_clean_direction_title:"Cur\u0103\u021bare pe direc\u021bia pardoselii",ground_material_clean_direction_detail:"\xcen modurile \u201eCur\u0103\u021bare complet\u0103\u201d \u0219i \u201eCur\u0103\u021bare selectiv\u0103 a camerei\u201d, robotul va cur\u0103\u021ba pe direc\u021bia pardoselii pentru a reduce frecarea \xeembin\u0103rilor pardoselii.\r\n*Seta\u021bi materialul pardoselii pentru ca aceast\u0103 func\u021bie s\u0103 fie eficient\u0103. Robotul poate cur\u0103\u021ba \xeentr-o singur\u0103 direc\u021bie.",map_edit_door_sill_exceed_limit:"A fost atins num\u0103rul maxim de praguri de u\u0219\u0103.",map_cliff_zone_guide_text:"Aici se detecteaz\u0103 des o zon\u0103 abrupt\u0103. Se configureaz\u0103 automat o \u201ezon\u0103 interzis\u0103\u201d.",map_stuck_point_guide_text:"Robotul se blocheaz\u0103 des aici. Configura\u021bi o \u201ezon\u0103 interzis\u0103\u201d.",map_door_sill_guide_text:"Aici s-a detectat un prag. Configura\u021bi o \u201ezon\u0103 cu prag\u201d.",clean_route_fast_mode_title:"Puternic",wifi_rssi_title:"Intensitatea semnalului",map_object_desc_sanxian:"Cablurile/firele au fost evitate, prevenind \xeencurcarea. Cablurile lungi, sub\u021biri se pot \xeencurca.",map_object_desc_chongwu:"Recunoa\u0219terea animalelor pentru a preveni coliziunea \u0219i deranjarea acestora.",map_object_desc_zhituan:"Recunoa\u0219terea produselor textile/h\xe2rtiei mototolite pentru a preveni \xeencurcarea \u0219i blocarea.",map_object_name_loosewire:"Cabluri/fire",map_object_name_cat:"Animal",map_object_name_dog:"Animal",map_object_name_curledfabric:"Produse textile/h\xe2rtie mototolit\u0103",auto_delivery_cleaning_fluid_title:"Umplerea inteligent\u0103 cu solu\u021bie de cur\u0103\u021bare",auto_delivery_cleaning_fluid_desc:"Solu\u021bia de cur\u0103\u021bare este ad\u0103ugat\u0103 automat \xeen timpul sp\u0103l\u0103rii cu mopul \u0219i a reumplerii rezervorului.",clean_route_fast_mode_guide_title:"Mod de cur\u0103\u021bare rapid\u0103 cu o eficien\u021b\u0103 superioar\u0103.",clean_route_fast_mode_guide_desc:"Robotul \xeenva\u021b\u0103 despre locul respectiv \u0219i \xee\u0219i ajusteaz\u0103 traseul \xeen consecin\u021b\u0103 pentru o cur\u0103\u021bare mai bun\u0103. Zonele marginale ale camerei nu vor fi incluse. Aceast\u0103 func\u021bie este destinat\u0103 doar utiliz\u0103rii ocazionale.",clean_route_fast_mode_is_work:"Modul de cur\u0103\u021bare rapid\u0103",home_sepecial_tip_cleanmop_fastroute:"Modul de cur\u0103\u021bare rapid\u0103 | O singur\u0103 utilizare",livecall_autosoundoff_whenmoving_alerttitle:"Apel \xeen mi\u0219care",livecall_autosoundoff_whenmoving_alertdesc:"Se ini\u021biaz\u0103 un apel \xeen mi\u0219care. Setat implicit la \u201eF\u0103r\u0103 sunet\u201d. Activa\u021bi sunetul dac\u0103 este necesar.",carpet_clean_mode_detail4:"Potrivit pentru pre\u0219uri \u0219i covora\u0219e. Atunci c\xe2nd se detecteaz\u0103 un covor, mopul se ridic\u0103 \u0219i fluxul de ap\u0103 este oprit pentru aspirarea covorului.",clean_route_setting_title:"Traseu",map_object_desc_general_1:"Folosind laserul liniar \u0219i o serie de al\u021bi senzori, robotul poate identifica \u0219i evita o gam\u0103 larg\u0103 de obstacole.",robot_play_soundpackage_exception:"\xcencercare de ascultare e\u0219uat\u0103. Utiliza\u021bi direct.",offline_map_guide_title:"Hart\u0103 offline",offline_map_guide_desc1:"Dispozitivul se va \xeenchide automat dac\u0103 nu este pus la \xeenc\u0103rcat pentru mai mult de 12 ore. Activarea func\u021biei \u201eHart\u0103 offline\u201d v\u0103 permite s\u0103 afla\u021bi pozi\u021bia dispozitivului anterioar\u0103 trecerii \xeen modul offline.",offline_map_tips_title:"Pozi\u021bia dispozitivului anterioar\u0103 trecerii \xeen modul offline",offline_map_tips_subtitle:"Dispozitivul s-a aflat aici \xeenainte de trecerea \xeen modul offline. Rea\u0219eza\u021bi-l \xeen doc, iar acesta va reporni \u0219i se va conecta automat la re\u021bea.",upgrade_progress_view_title:"Se actualizeaz\u0103 firmware-ul",upgrade_progress_view_desc:"Nu se permite nicio opera\u021biune. A\u0219tepta\u021bi.",offline_map_tips_off_line_date:"Momentul trecerii offline",home_sepcial_info_airdry_finish_time_minute:"Se usuc\u0103 mopul, finalizare estimat\u0103 dup\u0103: ${minute} minut(e)",map_edit_furniture_open_cattoilet:"Cutie litier\u0103 pisic\u0103",map_edit_furniture_cat_toilet:"Litier\u0103 acoperit\u0103",map_edit_furniture_pet_cage:"Cu\u0219ca animalului de companie",map_edit_furniture_pet_waterloo:"Patul animalului de companie",map_edit_furniture_pet_bowl:"Bolurile animalului de companie",unlock_clean_route_fast_mode_guide_title:"Explora\u021bi modul de cur\u0103\u021bare rapid\u0103",unlock_clean_route_fast_mode_guide_desc:"Robotul trebuie s\u0103 se afle \xeentr-un loc familiar pentru a utiliza acest mod. Salva\u021bi harta \xeenainte de a \xeencerca acest mod.",water_updown_self_clean_title:"Autocur\u0103\u021barea docului \u0219i a elementului de umplere \u0219i scurgere",water_updown_self_clean_desc:"Cl\u0103te\u0219te baia de cur\u0103\u021bare \u0219i rezervorul integrat de ap\u0103 murdar\u0103 pentru elementul de umplere \u0219i scurgere; realizeaz\u0103 verificarea automat\u0103 a elementului.",water_updown_self_clean_button_title:"Pornire autocur\u0103\u021bare",water_updown_drain_title:"Golirea elementului de umplere \u0219i scurgere",water_updown_drain_desc:"Scurge\u021bi apa r\u0103mas\u0103 din rezervorul de canalizare \xeencorporat.",water_updown_drain_button_title:"Pornire scurgere",water_up_down_setting_item_title:"Set\u0103ri ale elementului de umplere \u0219i scurgere",water_up_down_setting_item_desc:"Cl\u0103te\u0219te baia de cur\u0103\u021bare; efectueaz\u0103 o verificare automat\u0103 a elementului.",product_info_dock_sn:"Num\u0103rul de serie al docului",product_info_dock_version:"Versiunea firmware a docului",error_up_water_title:"Eroare reumplere",error_up_water_desc:"Verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 robinetul este pornit \u0219i asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103 fluxul de ap\u0103 curge normal.",error_up_water_detail:"Verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 func\u021bioneaz\u0103 alimentarea cu ap\u0103. Dac\u0103 func\u021bioneaz\u0103, reconecta\u021bi cablul aferent elementului de umplere \u0219i scurgere \u0219i re\xeencerca\u021bi. Dac\u0103 problema persist\u0103, contacta\u021bi serviciul de asisten\u021b\u0103 pentru clien\u021bi.",error_drain_water_title:"Eroare scurgere",error_drain_water_desc:"Verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 exist\u0103 ceva care blocheaz\u0103 scurgerea \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rta\u021bi-l.",error_drain_water_detail:"Verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 exist\u0103 ceva care blocheaz\u0103 scurgerea \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rta\u021bi-l. Dac\u0103 problema persist\u0103, contacta\u021bi serviciul de asisten\u021b\u0103 pentru clien\u021bi.",error_clean_carousel_unsetuped_title:"Verifica\u021bi tava de cur\u0103\u021bare.",error_clean_carousel_unsetuped_desc:"Reinstala\u021bi tava de cur\u0103\u021bare.",error_clean_carousel_unsetuped_detail:"1. Fixa\u021bi tava de cur\u0103\u021bare \xeen locul destinat; 2. Asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103 scurgerea docului nu este blocat\u0103; 3. Fixa\u021bi capacul rezervorului de ap\u0103 murdar\u0103.",error_clean_carousel_water_full_title:"Tav\u0103 de cur\u0103\u021bare plin\u0103.",error_clean_carousel_water_full_desc:"Verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 exist\u0103 ceva care blocheaz\u0103 scurgerea \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rta\u021bi-l",error_clean_carousel_water_full_detail:"Scurgerea docului poate fi blocat\u0103 - verifica\u021bi \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rta\u021bi; \xeen caz contrar, verifica\u021bi \u0219i fixa\u021bi capacul rezervorului de ap\u0103 murdar\u0103 \u0219i \xeencuietoarea.",map_edit_map_unsave:"Salva\u021bi harta \xeenainte de a re\xeencerca.",charger_type_name_special:"Doc",valley_electricity_not_set_hint:"* Timpul de \xeenc\u0103rcare nu este stabilit. \xcenc\u0103rcarea \xeen afara orelor de v\xe2rf este inactiv\u0103.",dock_kit_setting0:"5 ore",washing_mode_updown_water_selfcleaning:"Autocuratare",washing_mode_updown_water_drain:"Golirea elementului de umplere \u0219i scurgere",wash_towel_mode_title_4:"Super profund",wash_towel_mode_desc_4:"Adecvat pentru instalarea elementului de umplere \u0219i scurgere \u0219i \xeembun\u0103t\u0103\u021be\u0219te sp\u0103larea cu mopul.",dock_panel_function_section_title:"Control asupra docului",dock_info_clear_water_box_title:"Rezervor de ap\u0103 curat",dock_info_clear_water_box_exception1:"F\u0103r\u0103 ap\u0103",dock_info_dirty_water_box_title:"Rezervor de ap\u0103 murdar",dock_info_dirty_water_box_exception1:"Plin/nu este instalat",dock_info_clean_fluid_title:"Compartiment pentru detergent",dock_info_clean_fluid_exception:"Solu\u021bie insuficient\u0103",dock_info_water_box_filter_title:"Filtru de ap\u0103",dock_info_item_gone_exception:"Nu este instalat",dock_info_dust_bag_exception:"Plin",toast_clean_then_mop_24hour:"Aspira\u021bi podeaua \xeenainte de sp\u0103lare pentru a preveni adunarea excesiv\u0103 a murd\u0103riei \u0219i pentru a ob\u021bine cea mai bun\u0103 cur\u0103\u021bare.",cliff_zones_save_failed:"Salvare e\u0219uat\u0103 a zonei abrupte interzise",inner_error_desc_151:"Eroare ventilator pentru uscare",inner_error_desc_152:"Umplere \u0219i golire - eroare pomp\u0103 de refulare",inner_error_desc_153:"Umplere \u0219i golire - eroare senzor cu efect Hall pentru nivelul apei curate/supapa electronic\u0103 de admisie a apei",inner_error_desc_154:"Eroare perie lateral\u0103",inner_error_desc_158:"Umplere \u0219i golire - eroare senzor cu efect Hall pentru nivelul apei murdare",inner_error_desc_159:"Umplere \u0219i golire - eroare comunicare",map_edit_furniture_floor_mirror:"Oglind\u0103 de podea",map_edit_split_too_small:"Suprafa\u021ba camerei e prea mic\u0103. Nu se recomand\u0103 \xeemp\u0103r\u021birea.",setting_auto_avoid_obstacle_title:"Evitarea reactiv\u0103 a obstacolelor",setting_auto_avoid_obstacle_desc:"Algoritmul de lumin\u0103 structurat\u0103 permite robotului s\u0103 detecteze \u0219i s\u0103 evite \xeen timp real obstacolele, reduc\xe2nd astfel riscul de blocare a acestuia.",error_water_carriage_drop_title:"Suportul mopului s-a desprins. ",error_water_carriage_drop_desc:"Reinstala\u021bi \u0219i relua\u021bi procesul.",error_water_carriage_drop_detail:"Suportul mopului s-a desprins, reinstala\u021bi \u0219i relua\u021bi procesul.",supplies_pearl_strainer_name:"Tav\u0103 de cur\u0103\u021bare",supplies_pearl_strainer_description:"Particulele mari g\u0103site \xeen timpul sp\u0103l\u0103rii r\u0103m\xe2n \xeen tava de cur\u0103\u021bare, pentru a preveni blocajele conductelor de ap\u0103. Cl\u0103ti\u021bi tava de cur\u0103\u021bare cel pu\u021bin o dat\u0103 pe lun\u0103.",alert_pause_current_task_then_selfclean:"Opri\u021bi sarcina curent\u0103 \u0219i porni\u021bi autocur\u0103\u021barea?",alert_pause_current_task_then_drain:"Robotul nu a terminat cur\u0103\u021benia. \xcencheia\u021bi sarcina curent\u0103 \xeenainte de a utiliza aceast\u0103 func\u021bie.",close_auto_dry_alert_desc:"Laveta mopului poate mirosi ur\xe2t dac\u0103 func\u021bia de uscare este oprit\u0103. Sigur dori\u021bi s\u0103 v\u0103 opri\u021bi func\u021bia?",drain_left_water_tip1:"1. A\u0219eza\u021bi robotul \xeen doc pentru \xeenc\u0103rcare. Asigura\u021bi-v\u0103 c\u0103 rezervorul de ap\u0103 murdar\u0103 (sau elementul de umplere \u0219i scurgere) \u0219i tava de cur\u0103\u021bare sunt instalate \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rta\u021bi suportul pentru mop.",drain_left_water_tip2:"2. Ap\u0103sa\u021bi \u201eStart golire ap\u0103 r\u0103mas\u0103\u201d \u0219i a\u0219tepta\u021bi golirea automat\u0103;",drain_left_water_tip3:"3. Dureaz\u0103 aprox. 5-10 minute. \xcen acest timp, nu muta\u021bi robotul din doc;",drain_left_water_tip4:"4. Alerta vocal\u0103 \u201eScurgere finalizat\u0103\u201d indic\u0103 golirea complet\u0103 a apei. Goli\u021bi rezervorul de ap\u0103 murdar\u0103 (sau elementul de umplere \u0219i scurgere). ",drain_left_water_title:"Goli\u021bi automat apa r\u0103mas\u0103",left_water_is_draining:"Robotul se gole\u0219te",start_drain_left_water:"Start golire ap\u0103 r\u0103mas\u0103",left_water_drain_page_title:"Modul serviciul de asisten\u021b\u0103 pentru clien\u021bi",inner_error_desc_128:"Modul de sp\u0103lare scurtcircuitat.",inner_error_desc_129:"Modul de sp\u0103lare deconectat.",setting_carpet_first_switch_title:"Cur\u0103\u021barea prioritar\u0103 a covoarelor",setting_carpet_first_switch_desc:"Dup\u0103 \xeenceperea cur\u0103\u021b\u0103rii, robotul va prioritiza aspirarea zonei cu covor, f\u0103r\u0103 a uda laveta mopului. Apoi, va continua sarcina de cur\u0103\u021bare.\n*Nu include pre\u0219urile.",skip_current_cleanarea_buttontitle:"Nu include zona curent\u0103",pearl_supplies_strainer_reset_content:"Tav\u0103 de cur\u0103\u021bare cl\u0103tit\u0103. OK?",setting_back_wash_interval:"${minute} minute",inner_error_desc_156:"Eroare doc ODD",robot_is_warm_up_tip_try:"\xcenc\u0103lzi\u021bi robotul, \xeencerca\u021bi din nou mai t\xe2rziu.",localization_strings_Main_MainPage_12:"Restabilire",unsave_map_alert_mess:"Harta s-a schimbat foarte mult. Dori\u021bi s\u0103 restaura\u021bi ultima hart\u0103?",unsave_map_alert_chargeroffset:"Este posibil ca harta s\u0103 se fi modificat. Dori\u021bi s\u0103 restaura\u021bi ultima hart\u0103?",donot_disturb_same_time_warning:"Orele de \xeencepere \u0219i finalizare coincid. V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 modifica\u021bi.",add_supplement_area_buttontitle:"Ad\u0103uga\u021bi zon\u0103",goto_supplememt_cleanarea_title:"Efectuare cur\u0103\u021bare complementar\u0103",home_page_pearl_supplies_strainer_upgrade_tip:"Tava de cur\u0103\u021bare nu a fost cur\u0103\u021bat\u0103 de mult timp. V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 o cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi.",pearl_slow_mop_guide_title:"Sp\u0103lare intens\u0103 a col\u021burilor",pearl_slow_mop_guide_detail:"Robotul se deplaseaz\u0103 pe o traiectorie mai dens\u0103 \xeen form\u0103 de arc de cerc, cu o vitez\u0103 redus\u0103, pivot\xe2nd corpul pentru a \xeembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bi \xeendep\u0103rtarea petelor grele; adecvat pentru suprafe\u021be numai dup\u0103 m\u0103turare.",floor_map_name_no_emoji:"Numele nu poate con\u021bine emoji.",smart_scene_sort:"Triere",supplement_zone_hint_view_title:"Efectuare cur\u0103\u021bare complementar\u0103 \xeen zona selectat\u0103",supplement_zone_hint_view_desc:"Continuare sarcin\u0103 curent\u0103 de cur\u0103\u021bare dup\u0103 cur\u0103\u021barea complementar\u0103 ",skip_current_area_alert_tip:"Dori\u021bi s\u0103 renun\u021ba\u021bi la zona curent\u0103 \u0219i s\u0103 continua\u021bi cu zona urm\u0103toare? \n* Renun\u021b\u0103 la zona curent\u0103 de aceast\u0103 dat\u0103.",corner_clean_switch_title:"Sp\u0103lare intens\u0103 a col\u021burilor",corner_clean_switch_desc:"Robotul va folosi cur\u0103\u021barea profund\u0103 a col\u021burilor, fiind un mod cu o singur\u0103 utilizare.",cannot_cornerclean_withfastclean_toast:"Robotul nu cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 zonele marginale \xeen modul Rapid, iar modul Sp\u0103lare intens\u0103 a col\u021burilor nu poate fi utilizat.",switchfastroute_withcornerclean_toast:"Dezactiva\u021bi sp\u0103larea intens\u0103 a col\u021burilor \xeenainte de a utiliza modul de cur\u0103\u021bare rapid\u0103. ",sub_cleanstatus_supplement_clean:"Cur\u0103\u021bare complementar\u0103",sub_cleanstatus_dirtyrepeat_clean:"Resp\u0103lare",toast_supplementclean_status_notready:"Cur\u0103\u021barea complementar\u0103 nu este disponibil\u0103 momentan",toast_supplementclean_finish:"Cur\u0103\u021bare complementar\u0103 finalizat\u0103. Se reia cur\u0103\u021barea altor zone.",toast_supplementclean_notreach:"Nu poate ajunge \xeen zona care necesit\u0103 cur\u0103\u021bare complementar\u0103",toast_supplementclean_partly_notreach:"Nu poate ajunge \xeentr-o parte a zonei care necesit\u0103 cur\u0103\u021bare complementar\u0103",alert_new_supplementcleantask_willoverride_oldtask:"Dup\u0103 \xeenceperea cur\u0103\u021b\u0103rii complementare, sarcina de cur\u0103\u021bare complementar\u0103 curent\u0103 se va \xeencheia.",home_specialtip_for_maxplus_clean:"Max+ | O singur\u0103 utilizare",charging_resume_clean_page_title:"\xcenc\u0103rcare \u0219i reluare",reminder_second_page_check:"Am \xeen\u0163eles",reminder_second_page_stop_task:"\xcencheia\u021bi sarcina curent\u0103",mode_panel_cleancount_title:"Nr. de cur\u0103\u021b\u0103ri",clean_count_times:"${count} ori",mode_setting_panel_cleanmop_tip:"Sp\u0103lare \u0219i aspirare pentru cur\u0103\u021bare zilnic\u0103",mode_setting_panel_pureclean_tip:"Doar aspirare, o dat\u0103",mode_setting_panel_puremop_tip:"Doar sp\u0103lare, o dat\u0103",cleanmode_maxplus_footnote:"Consum intensiv de energie, durata de via\u021b\u0103 a bateriei se scurteaz\u0103.",charging_dialog_title:"Activa\u021bi Vizualizarea de la distan\u021b\u0103 numai c\xe2nd robotul este la \xeenc\u0103rcat.",setting_realtime_video_switch_detail:"Dup\u0103 activare, pute\u021bi s\u0103 verifica\u021bi casa \xeen timp real.",real_time_video_call_volume_title_text:"Volumul apelului",real_time_video_call_volume_subtitle_text:"Ajusta\u021bi volumul difuzorului robotului \xeen timpul apelului ",real_time_video_waiting_dialog_before_top_title:"\xcen curs de activare...",recommend_global_hint:"Cur\u0103\u021bare profund\u0103. Potrivit\u0103 pentru cur\u0103\u021benia temeinic\u0103 din weekend.",recommend_dining_area_hint:"Cur\u0103\u021barea buc\u0103t\u0103riei \u0219i a sufrageriei. Potrivit pentru cur\u0103\u021barea dup\u0103 mas\u0103.",recommend_clean_then_mop_hint:"Se realizeaz\u0103 aspirarea \u0219i sp\u0103larea complete, \xeen acela\u0219i timp, pentru o igien\u0103 \xeembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bit\u0103.",setting_carpet_first_switch_desc_nocarpet:"Harta curent\u0103 nu are covor, accesa\u021bi Editare suprafa\u021b\u0103 pentru a seta un covor.",setting_ground_clean_setting:"Setare de cur\u0103\u021bare a pardoselii",setting_ground_clean_setting_title:"Editare suprafa\u021b\u0103",setting_ground_clean_setting_detail:"\xcembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bi\u021bi materialul de podea pentru o cur\u0103\u021bare mai eficient\u0103.",setting_ground_dirty_replenish_title:"Resp\u0103lare automat\u0103",setting_ground_dirty_replenish_detail:"Atunci c\xe2nd este detectat\u0103 o zon\u0103 murdar\u0103 \xeen timpul sp\u0103l\u0103rii, robotul se va \xeentoarce la doc pentru a sp\u0103la mopul \u0219i apoi va sp\u0103la de dou\u0103 ori.",toast_start_goto_supplementzone:"Se \xeendreapt\u0103 spre zona de cur\u0103\u021bare complementar\u0103",toast_will_leave_skipped_area:"P\u0103r\u0103se\u0219te imediat zona curent\u0103",wash_towel_mode_title_5:"Inteligent",wash_towel_mode_des_5:"Regleaz\u0103 automat volumul de ap\u0103 \u0219i durata de sp\u0103lare cu mopul \xeen func\u021bie de gradul de murd\u0103rie.",home_bottom_menu_command_tab:"Flux de lucru",avoid_collision_mode_title_close:"Niciunul",avoid_collision_mode_des_close:"Cur\u0103\u021barea col\u021burilor \xeentregii case. Atunci c\xe2nd \xeent\xe2lne\u0219te picioare de mobilier, mese \u0219i scaune, robotul va \xeencetini, va atinge col\u021bul \u0219i se va \xeentoarce, pentru a se asigura c\u0103 sunt cur\u0103\u021bate col\u021burile.",avoid_collision_mode_title_normal:"Standard",avoid_collision_mode_des_normal:"Evit\u0103 pe c\xe2t posibil coliziunile directe cu mobilierul, deoarece se pot produce coliziuni u\u0219oare cu picioarele meselor, scaunelor \u0219i paturilor, iar spa\u021biile \xeenguste pot fi ratate.",avoid_collision_mode_title_sensitive:"Mare",avoid_collision_mode_des_sensitive:"\xcencearc\u0103 s\u0103 evite coliziunile cu picioarele mobilierului, meselor, scaunelor \u0219i patului, care pot cauza scan\u0103ri lips\u0103 \xeen jurul meselor \u0219i scaunelor \u0219i \xeen jurul picioarelor meselor \u0219i scaunelor.",map_edit_zone_tag_entryway:"Hol",ground_material_clean_direction_warn:"Configura\u021bi direc\u021bia pardoselii pentru ca aceast\u0103 func\u021bie s\u0103 fie eficient\u0103. Accesa\u021bi Editare suprafa\u021b\u0103 pentru a seta.",localization_strings_setting_voice_tone:"Limb\u0103",localization_strings_setting_voice_record:"Istoric chat",localization_strings_setting_voice_assistant:"Asistent vocal",localization_strings_setting_voice_skill:"Asistent vocal",localization_strings_setting_voice_assistant_switch:"Dup\u0103 ce este pornit, robotul poate recunoa\u0219te comenzile vocale \u0219i poate efectua ac\u021biunile corespunz\u0103toare.",whether_to_delete_all_the_recorded:"Permisiunea de a \u0219terge toate \xeenregistr\u0103rile",add_smart_command:"Ad\u0103ugare fluxuri de lucru",powerful_clean:"M\u0103turat intensiv",slow_mop:"Profund\u0103+",recommend_deep_clean_hint:"Cur\u0103\u021bare profund\u0103. Potrivit\u0103 pentru cur\u0103\u021benia temeinic\u0103 din weekend.",recommend_powerful_clean:"Aspirare puternic\u0103 pentru a cur\u0103\u021ba podeaua f\u0103r\u0103 a \u0219terge cu mopul.",recommend_slow_mop:"Cur\u0103\u021barea temeinic\u0103 a petelor profunde de pe podea, f\u0103r\u0103 aspirare.",home_new_control_start_charge:"Revenire la doc",choose_map_hint_new_map:"Hart\u0103 de cur\u0103\u021bare curent\u0103",unsave_map_alert_chargeroffset_title:"Schimba