cul electric \u0219i s\u0103 nu se poat\u0103 deschide. Verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 exist\u0103 blocaje \u0219i deschide\u021bi-l manual.",dock_selfclean_clean_title:"Autocur\u0103\u021bare la andocare",dock_selfclean_clean_desc:"Cl\u0103te\u0219te baia de cur\u0103\u021bare; efectueaz\u0103 o verificare automat\u0103 a elementului.",dock_selfclean_drain_title:"Golirea elementului de umplere \u0219i scurgere",dock_selfclean_drain_desc:"Scurge\u021bi apa r\u0103mas\u0103 din baia de cur\u0103\u021bare \u0219i din rezervorul de ap\u0103 murdar\u0103 integrat.",dock_setting_clean_carousel_selfcleaning_desc:"Efectua\u021bi opera\u021biunea de autocur\u0103\u021bare. Aceasta va dura aproximativ 3 minute.",dock_setting_clean_carousel_startselfclean_desc:"Cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi manual tava de cur\u0103\u021bare a docului pentru a \xeendep\u0103rta murd\u0103ria.",dock_setting_clean_carousel_selfclean_title:"Autocur\u0103\u021barea t\u0103vii de cur\u0103\u021bare",start_cleancarousel_selfclean:"Pornire autocur\u0103\u021bare",stop_cleancarousel_selfclean:"Oprire autocur\u0103\u021bare",clean_smart_animation_text1:"Comutare la modul SmartPlan",clean_smart_animation_text2:"Ajustare mod de cur\u0103\u021bare",clean_smart_animation_text3:"Creare parcurs de cur\u0103\u021bare",setting_page_matter_title:"Conectare la re\u021beaua Matter",carpet_clean_mode_setting_global_settip:"Aceast\u0103 setare nu va avea efect pe covoarele cu set\u0103ri de cur\u0103\u021bare personalizate.",tap_zone_clean_button_without_map_tip:"Crea\u021bi o hart\u0103 \xeenainte de a ad\u0103uga o zon\u0103.",error_57_title:"Eroare la peria de \xeentre\u021binere a rezervorului de cur\u0103\u021bare",error_57_desc:"Verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 peria de \xeentre\u021binere a rezervorului de cur\u0103\u021bare s-a blocat.",error_57_detail:"\xcendep\u0103rta\u021bi \u0219i cur\u0103\u021ba\u021bi tava de cur\u0103\u021bare. Apoi, verifica\u021bi dac\u0103 exist\u0103 blocaje \xeen jurul periei de \xeentre\u021binere \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rta\u021bi-le.",setting_optimize_batter_detail:"Odat\u0103 activat\u0103 op\u021biunea, nivelul bateriei va fi calculat mai precis. Durata de func\u021bionare poate fi u\u0219or redus\u0103 pentru a permite aceast\u0103 ajustare.",setting_optimize_batter_title:"Nivel ajustat al bateriei",map_edit_eraser:"\xcendep\u0103rta\u021bi",map_edit_eraser_add:"Selecta\u021bi zona de \xeendep\u0103rtare",ground_clean_direct_plus:"Model de cur\u0103\u021bare",ground_clean_direct_plus_tip:"Alege\u021bi modelul de func\u021bionare prin care robotul cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 fiecare camer\u0103.",ground_clean_direct_plus_long:"Inteligent ",ground_clean_direct_plus_long_tip:"\xcen modurile \u201eCur\u0103\u021bare complet\u0103\u201d \u0219i \u201eCur\u0103\u021bare selectiv\u0103 a camerei\u201d, robotul va cur\u0103\u021ba pardoseala pe direc\u021bia mai lung\u0103 a fiec\u0103rei camere pentru a optimiza eficien\u021ba de cur\u0103\u021bare.",ground_clean_direct_plus_switch:"Modele mixte de cur\u0103\u021bare",ground_clean_direct_plus_switch_tip:"Robotul se va deplasa pe direc\u021bia perpendicular\u0103 raportat\u0103 la ultima cur\u0103\u021bare pentru a \xeembun\u0103t\u0103\u021bi performan\u021ba de cur\u0103\u021bare.\r\nProcesele de cur\u0103\u021bare vor dura mai mult.",ground_clean_direct_plus_floor:"Cur\u0103\u021bare pe direc\u021bia pardoselii",ground_clean_direct_plus_floor_tip:"\xcen modurile \u201eCur\u0103\u021bare complet\u0103\u201d \u0219i \u201eCur\u0103\u021bare selectiv\u0103 a camerei\u201d, robotul va cur\u0103\u021ba pe direc\u021bia pardoselii pentru a reduce frecarea \xeembin\u0103rilor pardoselii. *Seta\u021bi materialul pardoselii pentru ca aceast\u0103 func\u021bie s\u0103 fie eficient\u0103. Robotul poate cur\u0103\u021ba \xeentr-o singur\u0103 direc\u021bie.",timer_workday:"Zile lucr\u0103toare",timer_holiday:"Zile libere",dock_item_fan_running_tip:"Ventilatorul de r\u0103cire func\u021bioneaz\u0103 pentru a reduce temperatu