lsPage_19:"\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u0111\xe3 thay m\xe0ng l\u1ecdc",localization_strings_Setting_Supplies_DetailsPage_15:"Mua ngay",localization_strings_Setting_Supplies_DetailsPage_13:"C\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i kh\xf4ng th\xe0nh c\xf4ng",localization_strings_Setting_Supplies_DetailsPage_5:"C\xf2n l\u1ea1i",localization_strings_Setting_Supplies_DetailsPage_4:"\u0110\xe3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng",localization_strings_Setting_Supplies_Common_5:"B\xe0n ch\u1ea3i ch\xednh l\xe0 b\u1ed9 ph\u1eadn l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch ch\xednh c\u1ee7a robot, n\xf3 quay v\u1edbi t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 cao \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eb7t r\xe1c v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0a v\xe0o h\u1ed9p \u0111\u1ef1ng b\u1ee5i. Khi th\u1eddi gian l\xe0m vi\u1ec7c t\u0103ng l\xean, b\xe0n ch\u1ea3i ch\xednh s\u1ebd b\u1ecb m\xf2n, \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch. N\xean thay ch\u1ed5i ch\xednh b\u1eb1ng ch\u1ed5i m\u1edbi sau 300 gi\u1edd ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng ho\u1eb7c \xedt h\u01a1n.",localization_strings_Setting_Supplies_Common_4:"Ch\u1ed5i ch\xednh",localization_strings_Setting_Supplies_Common_3:"Ch\u1ed5i b\xean d\xf9ng \u0111\u1ec3 l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch r\xe1c \u1edf c\xe1c g\xf3c. N\xf3 ti\u1ebfp x\xfac v\u1edbi m\u1eb7t \u0111\u1ea5t theo g\xf3c xi\xean v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0a r\xe1c v\xe0o ch\u1ed5i ch\xednh. Khi th\u1eddi gian l\xe0m vi\u1ec7c t\u0103ng l\xean, ch\u1ed5i b\xean s\u1ebd b\u1ecb m\xf2n, \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch. N\xean thay ch\u1ed5i b\xean b\u1eb1ng ch\u1ed5i m\u1edbi sau 200 gi\u1edd ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng ho\u1eb7c \xedt h\u01a1n.",localization_strings_Setting_Supplies_Common_2:"Ch\u1ed5i c\u1ea1nh",localization_strings_Setting_Supplies_Common_1:"B\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc c\xf3 th\u1ec3 gi\u1eb7t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bao g\u1ed3m c\xe1c s\u1ee3i polymer, c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ng\u0103n ch\u1eb7n b\u1ee5i t\u1eeb h\u1ed9p b\u1ee5i tho\xe1t ra ngo\xe0i m\u1ed9t c\xe1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. Khi th\u1eddi gian l\xe0m vi\u1ec7c t\u0103ng 