H\xe3y l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch n\xf3 k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_64:"Vui l\xf2ng l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch h\u1ed9p b\u1ee5i k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi",localization_strings_Main_Constants_63:"H\u1ed9p b\u1ee5i ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ec7 sinh trong th\u1eddi gian d\xe0i",localization_strings_Main_Constants_62:"\u0110\xe3 ph\xe1t hi\u1ec7n l\u1ed7i n\u1ed9i b\u1ed9 trong m\xe1y ch\u1ee7 v\xe0 kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng. Vui l\xf2ng th\u1eed \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_60:"L\u1ed7i b\xean trong",localization_strings_Main_Constants_56:"D\xe2y ngu\u1ed3n c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ebf s\u1ea1c c\xf3 th\u1ec3 ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eafm \u0111\xfang c\xe1ch. Vui l\xf2ng c\u1eafm d\xe2y ngu\u1ed3n tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\xe0 th\u1eed s\u1ea1c l\u1ea1i.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_55:"Vui l\xf2ng \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u0111\xe3 c\u1eafm d\xe2y ngu\u1ed3n",localization_strings_Main_Constants_54:"Dock s\u1ea1c kh\xf4ng c\xf3 \u0111i\u1ec7n.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_53:"V\u1eadt l\u1ea1 c\xf3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t trong qu\u1ea1t ch\xe2n kh\xf4ng, vui l\xf2ng th\u1eed c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_51:"L\u1ed7i qu\u1ea1t ch\xe2n kh\xf4ng",localization_strings_Main_Constants_50:"Modul ch\u1ed5i b\xean ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\xf4ng b\xecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng, vui l\xf2ng th\u1eed c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng",localization_strings_Main_Constants_49:"Vui l\xf2ng th\u1eed c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng",localization_strings_Main_Constants_48:"L\u1ed7i modul ch\u1ed5i b\xean",localization_strings_Main_Constants_47:"Ph\xe1t hi\u1ec7n th\u1ea5y m\xe1y ch\u1ee7 b\u1ecb nghi\xeang trong qu\xe1 tr\xecnh kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng. Vui l\xf2ng \u0111\u1eb7t m\xe1y ch\u1ee7 tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i m\u1eb7t \u0111\u1ea5t b\u1eb1ng ph\u1eb3ng v\xe0 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea1i.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_46:"\u0110\u1eb7t robot \u1edf ch\u1ed7 b\u1eb1ng ph\u1eb3ng v\xe0 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea1i.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_45:"Robot b\u1ecb nghi\xeang",localization_strings_Main_Constants_44:"C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn t\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1ecb b\u1ea9n. V\u1ec7 sinh c\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn t\u01b0\u1eddng.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_43:"V\u1ec7 sinh c\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn t\u01b0\u1eddng",localization_strings_Main_Constants_42:"C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn t\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1ecb b\u1ea9n.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_41:"Nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 c\u1ee7a pin qu\xe1 cao ho\u1eb7c qu\xe1 th\u1ea5p, vui l\xf2ng \u0111\u1eb7t robot \u1edf v\u1ecb tr\xed nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 ph\xf2ng b\xecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng trong th\u1eddi gian ng\u1eafn, \u0111\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn khi nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i b\xecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng",localization_strings_Main_Constants_40:" vui l\xf2ng \u0111\u1eb7t robot \u1edf v\u1ecb tr\xed nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 ph\xf2ng b\xecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng trong th\u1eddi gian ng\u1eafn, \u0111\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ebfn khi nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9 tr\u1edf l\u1ea1i b\xecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng",localization_strings_Main_Constants_39:"B\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m nhi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed9",localization_strings_Main_Constants_38:"Vui l\xf2ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u1ea3i kh\xf4 \u0111\u1ec3 lau c\xe1c \u0111i\u1ec3m ti\u1ebfp x\xfac s\u1ea1c c\u1ee7a m\xe1y ch\u1ee7 v\xe0 l\xf2 xo s\u1ea1c c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ebf s\u1ea1c.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_37:"Vui l\xf2ng th\u1eed v\u1ec7 sinh v\xf9ng ti\u1ebfp x\xfac s\u1ea1c, c\u1eafm v\xe0 r\xfat ngu\u1ed3n \u0111i\u1ec7n r\u1ed3i th\u1eed l\u1ea1i",localization_strings_Main_Constants_34:"S\u1ea1c robot tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_33:"Pin y\u1ebfu",localization_strings_Main_Constants_32:"M\xe1y ch\u1ee7 \u1edf qu\xe1 g\u1ea7n b\u1ee9c t\u01b0\u1eddng \u1ea3o trong khi kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng ho\u1eb7c ph\xe1t hi\u1ec7n th\u1ea5y t\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1ea1nh. Vui l\xf2ng di chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\xed m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_30:"Ph\xe1t hi\u1ec7n v\xf9ng t\u1eeb tr\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1ea1nh",localization_strings_Main_Constants_29:"B\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc c\xf3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb t\u1eafc, vui l\xf2ng l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc; ho\u1eb7c b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc ch\u01b0a kh\xf4 ho\xe0n to\xe0n, vui l\xf2ng l\xe0m kh\xf4 n\xf3 trong \xedt nh\u1ea5t 24 gi\u1edd, n\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1, vui l\xf2ng thay b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_28:"L\xe0m kh\xf4 ho\u1eb7c v\u1ec7 sinh m\xe0ng l\u1ecdc",localization_strings_Main_Constants_27:"M\xe0ng l\u1ecdc b\u1ecb \u01b0\u1edbt ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb t\u1eafc",localization_strings_Main_Constants_26:"Vui l\xf2ng c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t l\u1ea1i h\u1ed9p b\u1ee5i v\xe0 b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi x\xe1c nh\u1eadn r\u1eb1ng ch\xfang \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1eafp \u0111\u1eb7t \u0111\xfang v\u1ecb tr\xed; n\u1ebfu l\u1ed7i v\u1eabn ti\u1ebfp di\u1ec5n sau khi l\u1eafp \u0111\u1eb7t t\u1ea1i ch\u1ed7, vui l\xf2ng th\u1eed thay th\u1ebf b\u1ed9 l\u1ecdc.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_25:"L\u1eafp h\u1ed9p b\u1ee5i v\xe0 m\xe0ng l\u1ecdc.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_24:"Ch\u01b0a l\u1eafp h\u1ed9p b\u1ee5i",localization_strings_Main_Constants_23:"Vui l\xf2ng d\u1ecdn s\u1ea1ch c\xe1c ch\u01b0\u1edbng ng\u1ea1i v\u1eadt xung quanh m\xe1y ch\u1ee7; n\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 d\u1ecdn s\u1ea1ch, vui l\xf2ng di chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\xed m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_22:"D\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p c\xe1c v\u1eadt c\u1ea3n xung quanh robot.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_21:"Robot b\u1ecb c\u1ea3n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_20:"Vui l\xf2ng xoay v\xe0 l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch b\xe1nh xe ch\xednh ho\u1eb7c di chuy\u1ec3n m\xe1y ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\xed m\u1edbi r\u1ed3i kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea1i",localization_strings_Main_Constants_19:"H\xe3y l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch b\xe1nh xe ch\xednh ho\u1eb7c di chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\xed m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u",localization_strings_Main_Constants_18:"Robot b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t, ho\u1eb7c b\xe1nh xe ch\xednh c\u1ee7a n\xf3 b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_17:"Th\xe1o ch\u1ed5i b\xean v\xe0 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea1i sau khi v\u1ec7 sinh",localization_strings_Main_Constants_16:"Th\xe1o v\xe0 v\u1ec7 sinh ch\u1ed5i c\u1ea1nh.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_15:"Ch\u1ed5i c\u1ea1nh b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_14:"V\u1ec7 sinh ch\u1ed5i ch\xednh v\xe0 \u1ed5 tr\u1ee5c, sau \u0111\xf3 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea1i.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_13:"V\u1ec7 sinh ch\u1ed5i ch\xednh v\xe0 \u1ed5 tr\u1ee5c.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_12:"Ch\u1ed5i ch\xednh b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_11:"Robot \u0111ang treo l\u01a1 l\u1eedng tr\xean kh\xf4ng. Vui l\xf2ng di chuy\u1ec3n n\xf3 \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\xed m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u. C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn v\xe1ch c\u0169ng c\xf3 th\u1ec3 do qu\xe1 b\u1ea9n. H\xe3y lau s\u1ea1ch c\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn v\xe1ch \u0111\xe1 \u0111\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf n\xf3.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_10:"V\u1ec7 sinh c\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn v\xe1ch v\xe0 \u0111\u01b0a robot \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\xed m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea1i.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_9:"L\u1ed7i c\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn v\xe1ch",localization_strings_Main_Constants_7:"\u0110\u01b0a robot \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\xed m\u1edbi v\xe0 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea1i.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_6:"B\xe1nh xe b\u1ecb ng\u01b0ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng",localization_strings_Main_Constants_5:"B\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ec7m va ch\u1ea1m b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t, vui l\xf2ng ch\u1ea1m v\xe0o n\xf3 nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf v\u1eadt l\u1ea1; n\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng c\xf3 v\u1eadt l\u1ea1, vui l\xf2ng di chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\xed m\u1edbi v\xe0 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_4:"L\xe0m s\u1ea1ch v\xe0 g\xf5 nh\u1eb9 \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1ee1 n\xf3 ra",localization_strings_Main_Constants_3:"V\xf2ng ch\u1ed1ng va b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t",localization_strings_Main_Constants_2:"C\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn \u0111o kho\u1ea3ng c\xe1ch laser b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb k\u1eb9t b\u1edfi v\u1eadt l\u1ea1. Vui l\xf2ng di chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ea7u laser \u0111\u1ec3 x\xf3a v\u1eadt c\u1ea3n ho\u1eb7c v\u1eadt l\u1ea1. N\u1ebfu kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n x\xf3a, vui l\xf2ng di chuy\u1ec3n n\xf3 \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1ecb tr\xed m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_1:"Vui l\xf2ng xoay \u0111\u1ea7u laser \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o n\xf3 kh\xf4ng b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n ho\u1eb7c k\u1eb9t.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_0:"L\u1ed7i c\u1ea3m bi\u1ebfn laser",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_2:"Th\u1eddi gian l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_1:"M\u1ee9c pin c\xf2n l\u1ea1i",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_0:"Khu v\u1ef1c l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_4:"Nh\u1eb9 nh\xe0ng",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_3:"T\u1ed1i \u0111a",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_2:"c\u01b0\u1eddng l\u1ef1c",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_1:"Ti\xeau chu\u1ea9n",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_0:"Im l\u1eb7ng",localization_strings_Common_Constants_19:"\u0110ang t\u1ea3i",localization_strings_Common_Constants_18:"Ngo\u1ea1i tuy\u1ebfn",localization_strings_Common_Constants_17:"\u0110\xe3 s\u1ea1c \u0111\u1ea7y",localization_strings_Common_Constants_15:"\u0110ang c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt",localization_strings_Common_Constants_13:"L\