c th\xeam v\xe0o b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3. Vui l\xf2ng x\xe1c nh\u1eadn r\u1eb1ng \u0111\u1ed3 n\u1ed9i th\u1ea5t \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1eb7t ch\xednh x\xe1c.",home_sepecial_tip_for_only_mop:"Ch\u1ec9 Lau | S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng M\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n",home_sepecial_tip_for_only_clean:"Ch\u1ec9 H\xfat b\u1ee5i | S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng M\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n",switch_ar_map_when_map_unsaved_tip:"Vui l\xf2ng l\u01b0u b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\xednh n\u0103ng n\xe0y",home_new_control_start_collect:"L\xe0m tr\u1ed1ng t\xfai ch\u1ee9a b\u1ee5i",robot_status_egg_attack:"qu\xe9t",reset_privacy_dialog_content:"Sau khi \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n b\u1ecb thu h\u1ed3i, thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb s\u1ebd b\u1ecb x\xf3a kh\u1ecfi t\xe0i kho\u1ea3n. N\u1ebfu mu\u1ed1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i l\u1ea1i.",new_dock_charging_or_full_charging_title:"Dock s\u1ea1c",robot_status_wait_charge:"\u0110ang \u0111\u1ee3i s\u1ea1c",robot_status_wait_charge1:"S\u1ea1c ngo\xe0i gi\u1edd cao \u0111i\u1ec3m",robot_status_wait_charge2:"Sau khi b\u1eadt, pin robot s\u1ebd ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea1c \u0111\u1ea7y trong kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian cao \u0111i\u1ec3m. Pin s\u1ebd kh\xf4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea1c trong c\xe1c kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian kh\xe1c ngo\u1ea1i tr\u1eeb vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ngu\u1ed3n \u0111i\u1ec7n an to\xe0n.",robot_status_wait_charge3:"L\u01b0u \xfd:\xa0\u0110\xe3 \u01b0u ti\xean T\u1eaft S\u1ea1c trong Gi\u1edd Cao \u0110i\u1ec3m",robot_status_wait_charge4:"1. Vi\u1ec7c s\u1ea1c trong gi\u1edd cao \u0111i\u1ec3m c\xf3 th\u1ec3 l\xe0 b\u1eaft bu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1ec3 ho\xe0n th\xe0nh d\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p.",robot_status_wait_charge5:"2. Qu\xe1 tr\xecnh s\u1ea1c s\u1ebd di\u1ec5n ra trong c\xe1c gi\u1edd cao \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1eb1m duy tr\xec ngu\u1ed3n \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u.",robot_status_wait_charge6:"* Th\u1eddi gian s\u1ea1c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\xe1c \u0111\u1ecbnh ph\u1ea3i d\xe0i h\u01a1n 6 gi\u1edd.",home_special_tip_for_wait_charge:"Qu\xe1 tr\xecnh s\u1ea1c t\u1ea1m d\u1eebng trong gi\u1edd cao \u0111i\u1ec3m.",voice_chat_alert:"T\u1ea1m d\u1eebng d\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p khi c\xf3 cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi. Ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c d\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p sau khi k\u1ebft th\xfac cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi. ",home_special_tip_for_charger_offset:"Tr\u1ea1m s\u1ea1c \u0111\xe3 chuy\u1ec3n v\u1ecb tr\xed nh\u01b0ng b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt.\xa0Nh\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec3 xem th\xf4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft.",choose_map_hint_old_map:"B\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 \u0110\xe3 l\u01b0u",dock_kit_setting1:"4 gi\u1edd",dock_kit_setting2:"2 gi\u1edd",dock_kit_setting3:"3 gi\u1edd",dock_kit_setting4:"C\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t S\u1ea5y",dock_kit_setting5:"S\u1ea5y t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng",dock_kit_setting6:"Th\u1eddi l\u01b0\u1ee3ng",dock_kit_setting9:"D\u1eebng S\u1ea5y",home_special_tip_for_new_map:"T\xecm th\u1ea5y b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 ch\u01b0a l\u01b0u. Nh\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec3 xem l\u1ea1i.",backup_map:"B\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 d\u1ef1 ph\xf2ng",recover_map:"Kh\xf4i ph\u1ee5c b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 d\u1ef1 ph\xf2ng",delete_map_hint_title:"B\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n x\xf3a b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3?",map_edit_delete:"X\xf3a",backup_success_hint:"B\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c sao l\u01b0u v\xe0o m\xe1y. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \"Kh\xf4i ph\u1ee5c b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3\" \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i l\u1ea1i b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3.",privacy_access_failure:"Kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i Th\u1ecfa thu\u1eadn Ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng. Truy c\u1eadp tr\xecnh c\u1eafm v\xe0 th\u1eed l\u1ea1i.",dock_kit_setting11:"H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng m\xe1y s\u1ea5y",dock_kit_setting12:"1. B\u1ed9 s\u1ea5y kh\xf4 l\xe0 m\u1ed9t thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed9c l\u1eadp, vui l\xf2ng \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o r\u1eb1ng b\u1ea1n \u0111\xe3 mua thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb s\u1ea5y kh\xf4.     2. Sau khi c\xe2y lau nh\xe0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch, qu\xe1 tr\xecnh s\u1ea5y s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u theo y\xeau c\u1ea7u. B\u1ea1n c\u0169ng c\xf3 th\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u s\u1ea5y th\u1ee7 c\xf4ng.",dock_kit_setting14:"K\xedch ho\u1ea1t ch\u1ee9c n\u0103ng s\u1ea5y",supplies_floor_cleaning_fluid:"N\u01b0\u1edbc lau s\xe0n",supplies_floor_cleaning_fluid1:"Dung d\u1ecbch t\u1ea9y r\u1eeda \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\xf3 th\u1ec3 l\xe0m s\u1ea1ch s\xe2u c\xe2y lau nh\xe0 v\xe0 lo\u1ea1i b\u1ecf v\u1ebft b\u1ea9n tr\xean s\xe0n m\u1ed9t c\xe1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. B\u1ea1n n\xean th\xeam dung d\u1ecbch n\xe0y khi c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft.",map_edit_floor_wood_tile:"g\u1ea1ch l\xe1t s\xe0n",smart_scene_custom_commands:"H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u1ee7a t\xf4i",smart_scene_recommend_commands:"H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t",smart_scene_more:"Xem th\xeam",smart_scene_input_dialog_title:"Nh\u1eadp t\xean h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn",smart_scene_edit_title:"Ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn",smart_scene_reached_max_command_count_toast_hint:"Ch\u1ec9 c\xf3 th\u1ec3 th\xeam t\u1ed1i \u0111a 10 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn",smart_scene_add_command_success:"\u0110\xe3 th\xeam",smart_scene_add_dining_room_and_kitchen_hint:"Ch\u1ecdn nh\xe0 b\u1ebfp v\xe0 ph\xf2ng \u0103n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n",smart_scene_add_command_button_title:"Th\xeam h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn y\xeau th\xedch c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n",smart_scene_edit_switch_map_warning_title:"Chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i b\u1ea3n \u0111\u1ed3 s\u1ebd x\xf3a t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 c\xe1c nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ee5",smart_scene_edit_button_title_done:"Ho\xe0n th\xe0nh",smart_scene_delete_timer:"X\xf3a L\u1ecbch",smart_scene_rename:"\u0110\u1ed5i t\xean",smart_scene_recommend_global_clean_title:"D\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p To\xe0n b\u1ed9",smart_scene_recommend_clean_after_meal:"D\u1ecdn d\u1eb9p sau b\u1eefa \u0103n",localization_strings_Setting_General_index_1:"T\xean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m",map_edit_custom_mode:"C\