. Se n\xe3o existir nenhum obst\xe1culo, deslocar o rob\xf4 e tentar novamente.",localization_strings_Main_Constants_1:"Verificar a exist\xeancia de obstru\xe7\xf5es e tentar novamente. ",localization_strings_Main_Constants_0:"Erro do Sensor LiDAR",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_2:"Tempo de Limpeza",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_1:"N\xedvel da Bateria",localization_strings_CommonModules_NumberView_0:"\xc1rea de Limpeza",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_4:"Delicado",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_3:"M\xe1x",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_2:"Turbo",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_1:"Equilibrada",localization_strings_Common_Protocol_0:"Silenciosa",localization_strings_Common_Constants_19:"A carregar",localization_strings_Common_Constants_18:"Offline",localization_strings_Common_Constants_17:"Carga Completa",localization_strings_Common_Constants_15:"A Atualizar",localization_strings_Common_Constants_13:"Erro",localization_strings_Common_Constants_12:"Limpeza Localizada",localization_strings_Common_Constants_11:"Em pausa",localization_strings_Common_Constants_8:"A Carregar",localization_strings_Common_Constants_6:"A Regressar \xe0 Base",localization_strings_Common_Constants_4:"Controlo remoto",localization_strings_Common_Constants_3:"Pronto",localization_strings_Common_Constants_2:"Em Suspens\xe3o",localization_strings_Common_Constants_1:"A Limpar",localization_strings_Common_Constants_0:"A Obter Informa\xe7\xf5es",map_edit_furniture_sofa_single:"Sof\xe1 individual",map_edit_furniture_sofa_double:"Sof\xe1 duplo",map_edit_furniture_sofa_three:"Sof\xe1 multi-assento",map_edit_furniture_sofa_sectional:"Sof\xe1 modular",map_edit_furniture_shoe_cabinet:"Sapateira",map_edit_furniture_wardrobe:"Guarda roupa",map_edit_furniture_night_stand:"Mesa de cabeceira",voice_chat_tips:"Para garantir a seguran\xe7a, o v\xeddeo ser\xe1 desconectado automaticamente ap\xf3s uma hora da chamada, ligue-o novamente.",back_wash_title1:"Por Sala"