5fka bir robot g\xf6rd\xfc\u011f\xfcnde hi\xe7bir marka veya renk ayr\u0131m\u0131 yapmayacak, nazik bir \xf6p\xfcc\xfckle sevgisini d\u0131\u015fa vuracak.\n\nUYARI: Roborock, hayata g\xf6zlerini a\xe7abilecek bebek robot elektrikli s\xfcp\xfcrgelerden ya da olas\u0131 bir makinelerin y\xfckseli\u015fi senaryosundan sorumlu tutulamaz.",egg_attack_start_title:"Ba\u015flat",armap_match_failed:"E\u015fle\u015fme hatas\u0131",armap_match_success:"Harita e\u015fle\u015fti",armap_delete_confirm:"Matrix haritas\u0131n\u0131 silmek istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz?",armap_scan_save_mesh_failed_toast:"Kaydetme ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z.",armap_scan_stop_confirm:"Durmak?",monitor_voice_privacy_dialog_title:"G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcl\xfc Aramalar i\xe7in Gizlilik Politikas\u0131",camera_monitor_voice_privacy_title:"G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcl\xfc Aramalar i\xe7in Gizlilik Politikas\u0131  ",armap_guide_title3:"3. Tarama ve harita \xe7\u0131karma i\u015flemini bitirin, ard\u0131ndan e\u015fle\u015ftirmenin tamamlanmas\u0131n\u0131 bekleyin.",armap_guide_title2:"2. T\xfcm duvarlar\u0131, zeminleri ve k\xf6\u015feleri tarad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zdan emin olarak odan\u0131n i\xe7inde dola\u015f\u0131n.",armap_guide_title1:"1. Mevcut haritay\u0131 Matrix ile taray\u0131n.",armap_guide_title:"Matrix Harita kullan\u0131m k\u0131lavuzu",armap_privacy_dialog_title1:"Bir kez kullan\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda, 3D model Art\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f Ger\xe7eklik e\u015flemesi i\xe7in telefonda saklanacakt\u0131r. ",armap_privacy_dialog_title:"Matrix Haritalama Gizlilik Politikas\u0131",smart_scene_clean_mode_setting_item_title:"Temizleme Modu",main_control_pause_quick_build_map:"Duraklad\u0131",main_control_resume_quick_build_map:"Haritalama",go_update:"G\xfcncelleme",clean_mode_max_plus:"MAX+",go_to_settings:"sete git",quick_create_map_alert_title:"Hal\u0131dan ka\xe7\u0131nma modunda h\u0131zl\u0131 e\u015fleme yap\u0131lam\u0131yor",led_alert_detail:"Destek \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n k