ng:"D\xfczenle",tanos_custom_mode_des_info:"Temizli\u011finiz ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirildikten sonra her oda ki\u015fiselle\u015ftirilmi\u015f ayarlar\u0131n\u0131za g\xf6re temizlenecektir.",tanos_s_mop_mode:"Paspas Rotas\u0131",tanos_s_mop_mode_general_frag:"Standart",tanos_s_mop_mode_fine_frag:"Derin",localization_strings_Common_custom_mode:"\xd6zell.",introduction_to_image_uploading8:"Foto\u011fraf\u0131n ki\u015fisel bilgilerinizi i\xe7erip i\xe7ermedi\u011fini kontrol edin",collecting_dusk_error35_desc:"Toz haznesi bo\u015falt\u0131lam\u0131yor",collecting_dusk_error35_title:"\u0130stasyonda Otomatik Bo\u015faltma gerilim hatas\u0131",collecting_dusk_error34_desc:"\u0130stasyon toz haznesi, filtre veya hava kanal\u0131 s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131. Kontrol edin ve temizleyin.",collecting_dusk_error34_title:"\u015earj istasyonu Otomatik Bo\u015faltma s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131",collecting_dusk_error33_desc:"\u015earj istasyonu toz haznesi veya filtre yerinde de\u011fil.",collecting_dusk_error33_title:"\u015earj \u0130stasyonunda Otomatik Bo\u015faltma fan hatas\u0131",collecting_dusk_error32_desc:"\u015earj istasyonu toz haznesi veya filtre tak\u0131l\u0131 de\u011fil",collecting_dusk_error32_title:"Toz haznesi veya filtre tak\u0131l\u0131 de\u011fil",robot_status_collecting_dust:"Bo\u015falt\u0131l\u0131yor",mainpage_stop_collect_dust:"Bo\u015faltmay\u0131 Bitir",monitor_obstacle_tip_right:"Robot sa\u011fa hareket edemez. L\xfctfen y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc de\u011fi\u015ftirin.",monitor_obstacle_tip_left:"Robot sola hareket edemez. L\xfctfen y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc de\u011fi\u015ftirin.",monitor_obstacle_tip_front:"Robot ilerleyemiyor. L\xfctfen y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc de\u011fi\u015ftirin.",image_processing_failure:"\u0130\u015flenemedi",introduction_to_image_uploading7:"Y\xfcklenemedi",introduction_to_image_uploading6:"Foto\u011fraf y\xfckleniyor\u2026",introduction_to_image_uploading5:"Y\xfckle",introduction_to_image_uploading4:"Foto\u011fraf\u0131n ki\u015fisel bilgilerimi i\xe7ermedi\u011fini onayl\u0131yorum",introduction_to_image_uploading3:"3. Gizlili\u011finizin korunmas\u0131 ile ilgili herhangi bir sorunuz varsa l\xfctfen Gizlilik Politikam\u0131za bak\u0131n ve burada verilen ileti\u015fim bilgilerini kullanarak bizimle ileti\u015fime ge\xe7in.",introduction_to_image_uploading2:"2. Y\xfckle'ye dokundu\u011funuzda, g\xf6nderilen foto\u011fraf ve se\xe7ilen engel t\xfcr\xfc anonim olarak buluta y\xfcklenecektir. Foto\u011fraf y\xfcklenmeden \xf6nce foto\u011frafta bulunabilecek hassas bilgileri (y\xfcz bilgileri vb.) i\u015flemek i\xe7in bir duyars\u0131zla\u015ft\u0131rma algoritmas\u0131 kullan\u0131lacakt\u0131r. \u0130\u015flenen foto\u011fraf, g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfclemeniz ve onaylaman\u0131z i\xe7in yukar\u0131da g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfclenecektir.",introduction_to_image_uploading1:"1. Y\xfcklemek i\xe7in se\xe7ti\u011finiz veriler, cihaz\u0131n tan\u0131ma oran\u0131n\u0131 iyile\u015ftirmek ve size daha iyi hizmetler sunmak \xfczere yaln\u0131zca tan\u0131ma modelini geli\u015ftirmek i\xe7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r.",image_processing_result:"G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfc i\u015fleme sonu\xe7lar\u0131",image_processing:"G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfc i\u015fleniyor\u2026",obstacle_photo_page_feedback:"Geri bildirim sa\u011fla",obstacle_photo_page_ignore:"Yok say",obstacle_photo_page_identify_mistakes:"Tan\u0131ma hatas\u0131 m\u0131?",actual_type_of_obstacle:"Ger\xe7ek engel t\xfcr\xfc",send_voice_again:"Yeniden g\xf6nder",monitor_privacy_dialog_title:"Uzaktan G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleme Gizlilik \u0130lkesi",alert_button_disagree:"Kabul etmiyorum",map_object_desc_sock:"LDS sens\xf6r\xfcn\xfcn y\xfckseklik s\u0131n\u0131rlamalar\u0131 nedeniyle, robot evinizdeki \xe7orap gibi yerde duran nesneleri alg\u0131layamayabilir. Bu nesneler ana f\u0131r\xe7aya dolanabilir ve temizlik kesintiye u\u011frayabilir. AI tan\u0131ma, robotun bu nesnelerden ka\xe7\u0131nmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131 olarak temizlik g\xf6revinin ba\u015far\u0131yla tamamlanmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar.",map_object_name_sock:"\xc7orap",gesture_password_title:"Deseninizi \xe7izin",map_object_cancel_privacy_loading:"veri i\u015fleniyor\u2026",monitor_bumper_tip_right:"Robotun sa\u011f\u0131nda Girilemeyecek B\xf6lge veya G\xf6r\xfcnmez Duvar alg\u0131land\u0131.",monitor_bumper_tip_left:"Robotun solunda Girilemeyecek B\xf6lge veya G\xf6r\xfcnmez Duvar alg\u0131land\u0131.",monitor_bumper_tip_front:"Robotun \xf6n\xfcnde Girilemeyecek B\xf6lge veya G\xf6r\xfcnmez Duvar alg\u0131land\u0131.",use_celluar_for_monitor_tip:"Videoyu h\xfccresel veri kullanarak izliyorsunuz.",open_real_monitor_firstly_tip:"\xd6nce Uzaktan G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfclemeyi etkinle\u015ftirin",connecting_video_security_channel:"G\xfcvenli video aktar\u0131m kanal\u0131 kuruluyor\u2026",map_object_cancel_privacy_stop:"Biti\u015f",map_object_cancel_privacy_timeout:"\u0130ptal zaman a\u015f\u0131m\u0131na u\u011frad\u0131. Tekrar deneyin.",map_object_cancel_privacy_success:"Ba\u015far\u0131yla iptal edildi",map_object_cancel_privacy_stop_robot_alert:"Gizlilik politikas\u0131n\u0131n iptal edilmesi mevcut g\xf6revi sonland\u0131racakt\u0131r.",map_object_desc_general_structure_light:"Robot, bir dizi ba\u015fka sens\xf6r taraf\u0131ndan da desteklenen yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 kullanarak \xe7ok \xe7e\u015fitli engellerden ka\xe7\u0131nabilir.",map_object_desc_general:"Robot, bir dizi ba\u015fka sens\xf6r taraf\u0131ndan da desteklenen stereoskopik g\xf6r\xfc\u015f\xfc kullanarak \xe7ok \xe7e\u015fitli engelleri tan\u0131mlayabilir ve onlardan ka\xe7\u0131nabilir.",map_object_privacy_alert_link:"Ger\xe7ek Lokasyon Gizlilik Politikas\u0131",map_object_privacy_alert:"Etkinle\u015ftirildikten sonra g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcler, g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfclenmek \xfczere robotun deposunda saklan\u0131r. Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar i\xe7in, \u015furaya bak\u0131n",map_object_privacy_reset_dialog_content:"Ger\xe7ek Alan Foto\u011fraf\u0131 iptal edildikten sonra art\u0131k g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfclenemez ve kullanmadan \xf6nce yeniden yetkilendirmeniz gerekir.",map_object_privacy_title:"Ger\xe7ek Lokasyon Foto\u011fraf\u0131 Gizlilik Politikas\u0131",map_object_enable_intro:"Tespit edilen engelin resimlerini harita sayfas\u0131nda g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleyin.\n*Alg\u0131lanan her engel i\xe7in cihaz belle\u011finde bir g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfc saklanacakt\u0131r. Baz\u0131 engel g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleri saklanmayabilir.",map_object_bubble_tip_avoid:"\xd6nlendi",realtime_video_info:"Uzaktan G\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleme S\u0131ras\u0131nda",realtime_video_sub_title_3_1:"G\xf6sterge \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 sesli uyar\u0131 olmadan yan\u0131p s\xf6necektir.",realtime_video_title_3:"G\xfc\xe7l\xfc",realtime_video_title_2:"Hassas",realtime_video_title_1:"Yan\u0131p s\xf6n\xfcyor",realtime_video_title:"Uyar\u0131 Seviyesi",confirm_start:"Temizleme ve Haritalama",map_object_desc_henggan:"Kol demirli mobilyalar, \xf6rne\u011fin yaylan\u0131r sandalye, s\u0131k\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 \xf6nlendi.",map_object_desc_poqi:"Fara\u015f veya benzeri nesnelerin s\u0131k\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 \xf6nlendi.",map_object_desc_zhiwu:"Kuma\u015f tan\u0131nd\u0131, dola\u015fma ve s\u0131k\u0131\u015fma \xf6nlendi.",map_object_desc_tizhongcheng:"Tart\u0131 s\u0131k\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 \xf6nlendi.",map_object_desc_dizuo:"Kaide s\u0131k\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 \xf6nlendi. Kaideler aras\u0131nda bar tabureleri, ayakl\u0131 vantilat\xf6rler, Roborock kablosuz elektrikli s\xfcp\xfcrge altl\u0131klar\u0131 vb. yer al\u0131r.",map_object_desc_shoe:"Ayakkab\u0131/terlik s\u0131k\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 \xf6nlendi.",map_object_desc_baba:"Evcil hayvan at\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131n kirlilik yaratmas\u0131 \xf6nlendi.",map_object_desc_chapai:"Uzatma kablosu dolanmas\u0131 \xf6nlendi.",map_object_desc_xian:"Kablo/Tel dolanmas\u0131 \xf6nlendi. Uzun ve ince kablolar yine de dolanabilir.",obstacle_photo_page_ignore_desc:"1. Bu \xf6zellik, yanl\u0131\u015f alg\u0131lanan engeller i\xe7in veya robotun daha sonra bu nesneden ka\xe7\u0131nmas\u0131n\u0131 istemiyorsan\u0131z kullan\u0131l\u0131r.\n2. Bu \xf6zellik silindi\u011finde, robot bu konumdaki bu t\xfcr nesnelerin hepsini yok sayacakt\u0131r.\n3. Bu nesnenin yeniden alg\u0131lanmas\u0131n\u0131 istiyorsan\u0131z haritay\u0131 silin ve yeniden harita \xe7\u0131kar\u0131n.",obstacle_photo_page_ignore_link:"\xd6nlemeye gerek yok, yok say\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131?",obstacle_photo_page_percent:"G\xfcven:",obstacle_photo_page_subtitle:"Tan\u0131ma sonu\xe7lar\u0131:",retry_after_30_seconds:"30 sn sonra yeniden deneyin",video_func_is_locked:"\u015eifre devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131",gesture_password_at_least_four_length:"Desen parolas\u0131 en az 4 nokta ile olu\u015fturulur.",reset_gesture_password_tip:"Onaylad\u0131ktan sonra \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanacak ve video kapat\u0131lacak ve ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 \u200b\u200bvideosunun yeniden etkinle\u015ftirilmesi gerekiyor.",forget_password:"\u015eifremi unuttum",title_skip:"Ge\xe7",microphone_is_occupied:"Mikrofon me\u015fgul. Daha sonra tekrar deneyin.",resetting_device_wifi_and_reconnecting:"WiFi mod\xfcl\xfc y\xfckseltmesi var, bu i\u015flevi kullanmak i\xe7in l\xfctfen cihaz\u0131n WiFi'\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131f\u0131rlay\u0131n ve yeniden ba\u011flay\u0131n",upgrading_the_App_to_the_latest_version:"Uygulama s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc d\xfc\u015f\xfck, l\xfctfen en son s\xfcr\xfcme y\xfckseltin.",playing_now_please_try_again_later:"Ses \xe7al\u0131n\u0131yor, l\xfctfen daha sonra tekrar deneyin",no_recording_is_available:"Ses kayd\u0131 yok",ask_if_go_record_setting:"Ses \xf6zellikleri etkinle\u015ftirilsin mi?",whether_to_delete_the_recorded:"Kay\u0131t silinsin mi?",let_go_of_send_up_slide_to_cancel:"G\xf6ndermek i\xe7in serbest b\u0131rak\u0131n, iptal etmek i\xe7in kayd\u0131r\u0131n",up_to_15s_can_be_recorded:"Maksimum kay\u0131t uzunlu\u011fu: 15 sn",send_voice_fail:"G\xf6nderilemedi",send_voice_success:"G\xf6nderildi",long_press_to_send_voice:"Bas konu\u015f",send_voice_record:"\u0130leti ge\