1k\u0131\u015fma e\u015fikleri boyunca temizlik yapmadan ak\u0131ll\u0131ca ve nazik\xe7e hareket eder.",map_edit_stuck_zone_title:"S\u0131k\u0131\u015fma Alan\u0131",map_edit_stuck_zone_detail:"Robot s\xfcrekli burada s\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131p kal\u0131yor. Robotun etraf\u0131ndan dola\u015fmas\u0131 i\xe7in bir yasak b\xf6lge belirleyin. *Bunu yapmak istemiyorsan\u0131z, \"Yoksay\"a dokunun.",map_edit_cliff_zone_title:"U\xe7urumlu Girilmez B\xf6lge",map_edit_cliff_zone_detail:"Burada tekrar tekrar u\xe7urum tespit edildi. Girilmez B\xf6lge, otomatik olarak ayarland\u0131. U\xe7urumun girilmez b\xf6lge olarak ayarlanmas\u0131 robotun daha verimli \xe7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar. *Robotun buraya d\xfc\u015fme riski yoksa bunu g\xf6rmezden gelebilirsiniz. \r\n*Girilmez b\xf6lgenin boyutu ve konumu yanl\u0131\u015fsa buna g\xf6re ayarlama yap\u0131n.",setting_carpet_deep_clean_switch_title:"Derin Hal\u0131 Y\u0131kama",setting_carpet_deep_clean_switch_desc:"Oda Temizli\u011finden sonra, robot her odadaki hal\u0131lar\u0131 ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 temizleyecektir. \n*Paspaslar dahil de\u011fildir.",map_ai_zone_bubble_set:"S\u0131k\u0131\u015fma alan\u0131n\u0131 onaylamak i\xe7in dokunun",map_ai_zone_bubble_adjust:"Girilmez b\xf6lgeyi ayarlamak i\xe7in dokunun",warning_for_will_delete_wifi:"Silme i\u015fleminden sonra robot bu WiFi a\u011f\u0131na ba\u011flanmay\u0131 denemeyecektir.",wifi_page_current_wifi:"Ge\xe7erli WiFi Ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131",wifi_page_others_wifi:"Di\u011fer WiFi Ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131",wifi_page_title:"WiFi",map_edit_floor_wood_width:"Zemin (Yatay)",map_edit_floor_wood_longti:"Zemin (Dikey)",ground_material_clean_direction_title:"Zemin y\xf6n\xfc boyunca temizle",ground_material_clean_direction_detail:"Tam Temizlik veya Se\xe7meli Oda Temizli\u011fi'nde robot, zemin izlerini minimum d\xfczeyde s\u0131y\u0131rmak i\xe7in zemini kendi y\xf6n\xfc boyunca temizleyecektir. *Bu i\u015flevin \xe7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\xe7in zemin malzemesini ayarlay\u0131n. Robot yaln\u0131zca tek bir y\xf6nde temizlik yapabilir.",map_edit_door_sill_exceed_limit:"Maksimum kap\u0131 e\u015fi\u011fi say\u0131s\u0131na ula\u015f\u0131ld\u0131.",map_cliff_zone_guide_text:"Burada tekrar tekrar u\xe7urum tespit edildi. Girilmez B\xf6lge, otomatik olarak ayarland\u0131.",map_stuck_point_guide_text:"Robot s\xfcrekli burada s\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131p kal\u0131yor. Girilmez b\xf6lge olarak ayarlay\u0131n.",map_door_sill_guide_text:"Burada e\u015fik tespit edildi. Bir e\u015fik b\xf6lgesi ayarlay\u0131n.",clean_route_fast_mode_title:"H\u0131zl\u0131",wifi_rssi_title:"Sinyal G\xfcc\xfc",map_object_desc_sanxian:"Kablolardan/tellerden ka\xe7\u0131n\u0131ld\u0131, dolanma \xf6nlendi. Uzun ve ince kablolar yine de dolanabilir.",map_object_desc_chongwu:"Evcil hayvanlar tan\u0131n\u0131r; \xe7arp\u0131\u015fma ve di\u011fer olumsuzluklar \xf6nlenir.",map_object_desc_zhituan:"Kuma\u015f/ka\u011f\u0131t toplar\u0131 tan\u0131n\u0131r; dola\u015fma ve s\u0131k\u0131\u015fma \xf6nlenir.",map_object_name_loosewire:"Kablolar/teller",map_object_name_cat:"Hayvan",map_object_name_dog:"Hayvan",map_object_name_curledfabric:"Kuma\u015f/ka\u011f\u0131t toplar\u0131",auto_delivery_cleaning_fluid_title:"Ak\u0131ll\u0131 Temizlik \xc7\xf6zeltisi Dolumu",auto_delivery_cleaning_fluid_desc:"Temizlik \xe7\xf6zeltisi, paspas y\u0131kama ve hazne doldurma s\u0131ras\u0131nda otomatik olarak eklenir.",clean_route_fast_mode_guide_title:"Daha y\xfcksek verimlilikle H\u0131zl\u0131 Temizleme Modu.",clean_route_fast_mode_guide_desc:"Robot, mekan\u0131 \xf6\u011frenir ve daha iyi bir temizlik i\xe7in rotas\u0131n\u0131 buna g\xf6re ayarlar. Oda s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 atlanacakt\u0131r. Bu i\u015flev yaln\u0131zca seyrek kullan\u0131mlar i\xe7indir.",clean_route_fast_mode_is_work:"H\u0131zl\u0131 Temizleme Modu",home_sepecial_tip_cleanmop_fastroute:"H\u0131zl\u0131 Temizleme Modu | Tek Kullan\u0131m",livecall_autosoundoff_whenmoving_alerttitle:"Hareket Halinde Arama",livecall_autosoundoff_whenmoving_alertdesc:"Hareket halindeyken bir arama ba\u015flar. Varsay\u0131lan olarak sessizdir. Gerekirse sesi a\xe7\u0131n.",carpet_clean_mode_detail4:"Paspaslara veya k\xfc\xe7\xfck boyutlu hal\u0131lara uygulanabilir. Bir hal\u0131 tespit edildi\u011finde, paspas kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r ve hal\u0131n\u0131n s\xfcp\xfcr\xfclmesi i\xe7in su ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 durdurulur.",clean_route_setting_title:"Rota",map_object_desc_general_1:"Robot, bir dizi ba\u015fka sens\xf6r taraf\u0131ndan da desteklenen lazer \xe7izgisini kullanarak \xe7ok \xe7e\u015fitli engelleri tan\u0131mlayabilir ve onlardan ka\xe7\u0131nabilir.",robot_play_soundpackage_exception:"Deneme dinlemesi ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu. Do\u011frudan kullanmay\u0131 deneyin.",offline_map_guide_title:"\xc7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 Harita",offline_map_guide_desc1:"Cihaz 12 saatten uzun s\xfcre \u015farj edilmeden b\u0131rak\u0131l\u0131rsa otomatik olarak kapanacakt\u0131r. \xc7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 Haritay\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirmek, cihaz\u0131n \xe7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 olmadan \xf6nce nerede oldu\u011funu bilmenizi sa\u011flar.",offline_map_tips_title:"\xc7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 Olmadan \xd6nceki Cihaz Konumu",offline_map_tips_subtitle:"Cihaz \xe7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 olmadan \xf6nce buradayd\u0131. Cihaz\u0131 tekrar ba\u011flant\u0131 istasyonuna yerle\u015ftirdi\u011finizde cihaz \xe7al\u0131\u015facak ve otomatik olarak a\u011fa ba\u011flanacakt\u0131r.",upgrade_progress_view_title:"\xdcr\xfcn Yaz\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 G\xfcncelleme",upgrade_progress_view_desc:"Hi\xe7bir i\u015fleme izin verilmiyor. L\xfctfen bekleyin.",offline_map_tips_off_line_date:"\xc7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 Zaman",home_sepcial_info_airdry_finish_time_minute:"Paspas kurutma, tahmini biti\u015f s\xfcresi: ${minute} dakika",map_edit_furniture_open_cattoilet:"Kedi Kumu Kab\u0131",map_edit_furniture_cat_toilet:"Kapal\u0131 \xe7\xf6p kab\u0131",map_edit_furniture_pet_cage:"Evcil hayvan kafesi",map_edit_furniture_pet_waterloo:"Evcil hayvan yata\u011f\u0131",map_edit_furniture_pet_bowl:"Evcil hayvan kaplar\u0131",unlock_clean_route_fast_mode_guide_title:"H\u0131zl\u0131 Temizleme Modunu A\xe7",unlock_clean_route_fast_mode_guide_desc:"Robot, bu modu kullanabilmek i\xe7in bildi\u011fi bir yerde olmal\u0131d\u0131r. Bu modu denemeden \xf6nce haritay\u0131 kaydedin.",water_updown_self_clean_title:"Ba\u011flant\u0131 istasyonu ve Doldurma ve Bo\u015faltma Eleman\u0131 Kendi Kendini Temizlemesi",water_updown_self_clean_desc:"Doldurma bo\u015faltma eleman\u0131 i\xe7in temizleme teknesini ve dahili at\u0131k su haznesini y\u0131kar; doldurma bo\u015faltma eleman\u0131 \xfczerinde kendi kendine kontrol ger\xe7ekle\u015ftirir.",water_updown_self_clean_button_title:"Kendi Kendine Temizli\u011fi Ba\u015flat",water_updown_drain_title:"Doldurma ve Bo\u015faltma Eleman\u0131 Tahliyesi",water_updown_drain_desc:"Kalan suyu yerle\u015fik kanalizasyon tank\u0131ndan bo\u015falt\u0131n.",water_updown_drain_button_title:"Bo\u015faltmay\u0131 Ba\u015flat",water_up_down_setting_item_title:"Doldurma ve Bo\u015faltma Ayarlar\u0131",water_up_down_setting_item_desc:"Temizleme teknesini y\u0131kar; doldurma bo\u015faltma eleman\u0131 \xfczerinde kendi kendine kontrol ger\xe7ekle\u015ftirir.",product_info_dock_sn:"Ba\u011flant\u0131 istasyonu SN",product_info_dock_version:"Ba\u011flant\u0131 istasyonu \xdcr\xfcn Yaz\u0131l\u0131m\u0131 S\xfcr\xfcm\xfc",error_up_water_title:"Yeniden doldurma hatas\u0131",error_up_water_desc:"Muslu\u011fun a\xe7\u0131k olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin ve suyun normal \u015fekilde akt\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan emin olun.",error_up_water_detail:"Su kayna\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n kullan\u0131labilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin. Bunlarda bir sorun yoksa doldurma ve bo\u015faltma eleman\u0131n\u0131n ba\u011flant\u0131 kablosunu yeniden tak\u0131n ve tekrar deneyin. Sorun devam ederse m\xfc\u015fteri deste\u011fiyle ileti\u015fime ge\xe7in.",error_drain_water_title:"Tahliye hatas\u0131",error_drain_water_desc:"Tahliye \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 t\u0131kayan herhangi bir \u015fey olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin ve varsa \xe7\u0131kar\u0131n.",error_drain_water_detail:"Tahliye \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 t\u0131kayan herhangi bir \u015fey olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin ve varsa \xe7\u0131kar\u0131n. Sorun devam ederse m\xfc\u015fteri deste\u011fiyle ileti\u015fime ge\xe7in.",error_clean_carousel_unsetuped_title:"L\xfctfen temizleme tepsisini kontrol edin.",error_clean_carousel_unsetuped_desc:"Temizleme tepsisini yeniden tak\u0131n.",error_clean_carousel_unsetuped_detail:"1. Temizleme tepsisini yerine sabitleyin; 2. \u0130stasyon su \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131nda herhangi bir t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131k olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin; 3. L\xfctfen kirli su haznesi kapa\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edip sabitleyin.",error_clean_carousel_water_full_title:"Temizleme tepsisi dolu.",error_clean_carousel_water_full_desc:"Su \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131nda herhangi bir t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131k olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin ve varsa giderin",error_clean_carousel_water_full_detail:"Ba\u011flant\u0131 istasyonu su \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 t\u0131kal\u0131 olabilir, l\xfctfen kontrol edin ve t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131k varsa giderin; t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131k yoksa kirli hazne kapa\u011f\u0131n\u0131 ve mandal\u0131 kontrol edin ve yerine sabitleyin.",map_edit_map_unsave:"Tekrar denemeden \xf6nce haritay\u0131 kaydedin.",charger_type_name_special:"\u015earj \u0130stasyonu",valley_electricity_not_set_hint:"* \u015earj s\xfcresi ayarlanmam\u0131\u015f. Yo\u011fun olmayan saatlerde \u015farj aktif de\u011fil.",dock_kit_setting0:"5 saat",washing_mode_updown_water_selfcleaning:"Kendi kendini temizleme",washing_mode_updown_water_drain:"Doldurma ve bo\u015faltma eleman\u0131 tahliyesi",wash_towel_mode_title_4:"S\xfcper Derin",wash_towel_mode_desc_4:"Doldurma ve bo\u015faltma eleman\u0131n\u0131 takmak i\xe7in uygundur ve paspas y\u0131kamay\u0131 iyile\u015ftirir.",dock_panel_function_section_title:"Ba\u011flant\u0131 \u0130stasyonu Kontrol\xfc",dock_info_clear_water_box_title:"Temiz Su Haznesi",dock_info_clear_water_box_exception1:"Su bitmi\u015f",dock_info_dirty_water_box_title:"Kirli Su Haznesi",dock_info_dirty_water_box_exception1:"Dolu/Tak\u0131l\u0131 de\u011fil",dock_info_clean_fluid_title:"Deterjan Kartu\u015fu",dock_info_clean_fluid_exception:"S\u0131v\u0131 seviyesi az",dock_info_water_box_filter_title:"Su Filtresi",dock_info_item_gone_exception:"Tak\u0131l\u0131 de\u011fil",dock_info_dust_bag_exception:"Dolu",toast_clean_then_mop_24hour:"A\u015f\u0131r\u0131 kir birikmesini \xf6nlemek ve en iyi temizlik performans\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flamak i\xe7in paspaslamadan \xf6nce zemini s\xfcp\xfcr\xfcn.",cliff_zones_save_failed:"U\xe7urumlu girilmez b\xf6lge kayd\u0131 ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu",inner_error_desc_151:"Kurutma fan\u0131 hatas\u0131",inner_error_desc_152:"Doldurma ve Bo\u015faltma - pompa hatas\u0131",inner_error_desc_153:"Doldurma ve Bo\u015faltma - su giri\u015fi elektronik valfi/temiz su seviyesi Hol sens\xf6r\xfc hatas\u0131",inner_error_desc_154:"Yan f\u0131r\xe7a hatas\u0131",inner_error_desc_158:"Doldurma ve Bo\u015faltma - kirli su seviyesi Hol sens\xf6r\xfc hatas\u0131",inner_error_desc_159:"Doldurma ve Bo\u015faltma - ileti\u015fim hatas\u0131",map_edit_furniture_floor_mirror:"Yer Aynas\u0131",map_edit_split_too_small:"Odadaki alan \xe7ok k\xfc\xe7\xfck, b\xf6l\xfcnme yap\u0131lmas\u0131 \xf6nerilmez.",setting_auto_avoid_obstacle_title:"Engellerden Tepkisel Ka\xe7\u0131nma",setting_auto_avoid_obstacle_desc:"Yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f \u0131\u015f\u0131k algoritmas\u0131, robotun engelleri ger\xe7ek zamanl\u0131 olarak alg\u0131lay\u0131p onlardan ka\xe7\u0131nmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flayarak tuza\u011fa d\xfc\u015fme olaylar\u0131n\u0131 en aza indirir.",error_water_carriage_drop_title:"Paspas yerinden \xe7\u0131kt\u0131. ",error_water_carriage_drop_desc:"Devam etmek i\xe7in yeniden tak\u0131n.",error_water_carriage_drop_detail:"Paspas bezi yerinden \xe7\u0131kt\u0131, devam etmek i\xe7in yeniden tak\u0131n.",supplies_pearl_strainer_name:"Temizleme Tepsisi",supplies_pearl_strainer_description:"Paspas y\u0131kama s\u0131ras\u0131nda bulunan b\xfcy\xfck par\xe7alar, su borusunu t\u0131kamamas\u0131 i\xe7in temizleme tepsisinde b\u0131rak\u0131lacakt\u0131r. Temizleme tepsisini ayda en az bir kez durulay\u0131n.",alert_pause_current_task_then_selfclean:"G\xf6rev sonland\u0131r\u0131l\u0131p kendi kendine temizlik ba\u015flat\u0131ls\u0131n m\u0131?",alert_pause_current_task_then_drain:"Temizlik devam ediyor. D\xfczenleme yapmadan \xf6nce temizli\u011fi bitirin.",close_auto_dry_alert_desc:"Kurutma i\u015flevi kapat\u0131l\u0131rsa paspas bezinde k\xf6t\xfc koku olu\u015fabilir. Kapatmak istedi\u011finizden emin misiniz?",drain_left_water_tip1:"1. L\xfctfen robotu istasyona yerle\u015ftirip \u015farjda tutun. Kirli su haznesi (veya doldurma bo\u015faltma eleman\u0131) ve temizleme tepsisinin yerine tak\u0131l\u0131 oldu\u011fundan emin olun ve paspas bezi yuvas\u0131n\u0131 \xe7\u0131kar\u0131n.",drain_left_water_tip2:"2. \"Kalan suyu bo\u015faltmaya ba\u015fla\" se\xe7ene\u011fine dokunup otomatik olarak tamamlanmas\u0131n\u0131 bekleyin;",drain_left_water_tip3:"3. Bu, yakla\u015f\u0131k 5-10 dakika al\u0131r. L\xfctfen bekleyin ve robot ile ba\u011flant\u0131 istasyonuna dokunmay\u0131n;",drain_left_water_tip4:"4. Robot sesli uyar\u0131s\u0131 \"Bo\u015faltma tamamland\u0131\" uyar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 verince, kalan suyun bo\u015falt\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirtir. L\xfctfen kirli su tank\u0131n\u0131 (veya doldurma ve bo\u015faltma eleman\u0131n\u0131) bo\u015falt\u0131n.",drain_left_water_title:"Kalan suyu otomatik olarak bo\u015falt",left_water_is_draining:"Robot bo\u015faltma yap\u0131yor",start_drain_left_water:"Kalan suyu bo\u015faltmaya ba\u015fla",left_water_drain_page_title:"M\xfc\u015fteri Destek Modu",inner_error_desc_128:"Paspas mod\xfcl\xfc k\u0131sa devre yapt\u0131.",inner_error_desc_129:"Paspas mod\xfcl\xfcn\xfcn ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 kesildi.",setting_carpet_first_switch_title:"\xd6nce Hal\u0131 Temizli\u011fi",setting_carpet_first_switch_desc:"Temizleme g\xf6revi ba\u015flad\u0131ktan sonra robot, paspas bezini \u0131slatmadan hal\u0131 kapl\u0131 alan\u0131 s\xfcp\xfcrmeye \xf6ncelik verecektir. Ard\u0131ndan temizlik g\xf6revine devam edecektir.\n*Kap\u0131 paspaslar\u0131/kilimler dahil de\u011fildir.",skip_current_cleanarea_buttontitle:"Ge\xe7erli b\xf6lgeyi atla",pearl_supplies_strainer_reset_content:"Temizleme tepsisi duruland\u0131. Tamam m\u0131?",setting_back_wash_interval:"${minute} dakika",inner_error_desc_156:"Ba\u011flant\u0131 istasyonu ODD Hatas\u0131",robot_is_warm_up_tip_try:"Robot \u0131s\u0131n\u0131yor, l\xfctfen daha sonra tekrar deneyin.",localization_strings_Main_MainPage_12:"Geri Y\xfckle",unsave_map_alert_mess:"Haritada \xe7ok fazla de\u011fi\u015fiklik yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015f. Son haritay\u0131 geri y\xfcklemek istiyor musunuz?",unsave_map_alert_chargeroffset:"Haritada de\u011fi\u015fiklik yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015f olabilir. Son haritay\u0131 geri y\xfcklemek istiyor musunuz?",donot_disturb_same_time_warning:"Ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 ve biti\u015f zamanlar\u0131 ayn\u0131d\u0131r. L\xfctfen ayarlay\u0131n.",add_supplement_area_buttontitle:"Alan Ekle",goto_supplememt_cleanarea_title:"Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 Temizlik Uygula",home_page_pearl_supplies_strainer_upgrade_tip:"Temizleme tepsisi uzun bir s\xfcredir temizlenmedi. L\xfctfen temizleyin.",pearl_slow_mop_guide_title:"K\xf6\u015feler i\xe7in G\xfc\xe7l\xfc Paspaslama",pearl_slow_mop_guide_detail:"Robot, d\xfc\u015f\xfck h\u0131zda daha yo\u011fun kavisli bir rota \xfczerinde hareket eder, a\u011f\u0131r kirlerin daha iyi temizlenmesi i\xe7in kendi etraf\u0131nda d\xf6ner ve yaln\u0131zca s\xfcp\xfcrme i\u015flemi uygulanm\u0131\u015f y\xfczeyler i\xe7in uygundur.",floor_map_name_no_emoji:"\u0130sim emoji i\xe7eremez.",smart_scene_sort:"S\u0131ralama",supplement_zone_hint_view_title:"Se\xe7ilen B\xf6lgede Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 Temizlik Yap",supplement_zone_hint_view_desc:"Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 Temizlikten sonra ge\xe7erli temizlik g\xf6revine devam et ",skip_current_area_alert_tip:"Ge\xe7erli alan\u0131 atlay\u0131p bir sonraki alana ge\xe7mek ister misiniz? \n* Bu seferlik ge\xe7erli alan\u0131 atlay\u0131n.",corner_clean_switch_title:"Y\xfcksek Yo\u011funluklu K\xf6\u015fe Paspaslama",corner_clean_switch_desc:"Robot, k\xf6\u015felerde tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131k bir mod olan Derin modu tamamlayacakt\u0131r.",cannot_cornerclean_withfastclean_toast:"Robot, H\u0131zl\u0131 modda s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 temizlemez ve K\xf6\u015feler i\xe7in Y\xfcksek Yo\u011funluklu Paspaslama modu kullan\u0131lamaz.",switchfastroute_withcornerclean_toast:"H\u0131zl\u0131 Temizleme modunu kullanmadan \xf6nce l\xfctfen K\xf6\u015feler i\xe7in Y\xfcksek Yo\u011funluklu Paspaslamay\u0131 kapat\u0131n. ",sub_cleanstatus_supplement_clean:"Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 temizlik",sub_cleanstatus_dirtyrepeat_clean:"Yeniden paspaslama",toast_supplementclean_status_notready:"Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 temizlik \u015fimdi desteklenmiyor",toast_supplementclean_finish:"Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 temizlik tamamland\u0131. Di\u011fer alanlar\u0131 temizlemeye devam edin.",toast_supplementclean_notreach:"Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 temizlik alan\u0131na ula\u015f\u0131lam\u0131yor",toast_supplementclean_partly_notreach:"Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 temizlik alan\u0131n\u0131n bir k\u0131sm\u0131na ula\u015f\u0131lam\u0131yor",alert_new_supplementcleantask_willoverride_oldtask:"Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 temizlik ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda, ge\xe7erli Tamamlay\u0131c\u0131 temizlik g\xf6revi sona erecektir.",home_specialtip_for_maxplus_clean:"Max+ | Tek Kullan\u0131